{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SttBg7AcVFPyekWNMUQJ5t","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。以 Simpson''s Paradox 几何洞见为核心新颖性开篇—— raw CKA-transfer\n2\t  correlation 为负（depth confound），partial correlation controlling for depth 在双架构上均显著为正（p\n3\t  < 0.01），揭示 within-layer CKA genuinely predicts transfer quality。CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献（+3.5pp\n4\t  mean over ZS），不是 headline 但 构成因果链第三环。标题强调 ''geometric analysis reveals when and\n5\t  why cross-lingual calibration transfer succeeds''。四条 claim 完整因果链保留：Pareto discovery（architecture-\n6\t  dependent depth-transferability tradeoff）→ Decomposition analysis（difficulty vs\n7\t  capability separation）→ CaCLR method（consistency loss provides measurable gain at\n8\t  deep layers）→ CKA geometric explanation（Simpson''s Paradox, subspace persistence）。\n9\t  Control task warning（28% low-resource artifacts）和 linear projection sample efficiency\n10\t  （~42 pairs to 95%）作为加分实证贡献。Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52） 为 practitioner\n11\t  提供直接指导。无需弱化任何 claims。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B\n16\t  plan_id: plan_001\n17\t  description: '94-layer MoE (INT4, ~22B active), 24 probed layers (every 4th), 20\n18\t    typologically diverse languages, English logistic regression probes, 5 transfer\n19\t    conditions: zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection (200 pairs), few-shot 25/100,\n20\t    CaCLR。重点验证 MVP 发现的 strong depth-transferability tradeoff 是否在大模型上保持。\n21\t\n22\t    '\n23\t  expected_results:\n24\t    en_best_auroc: 0.81\n25\t    en_best_layer_idx: 72\n26\t    en_auroc_range:\n27\t    - 0.58\n28\t    - 0.81\n29\t    en_ece_raw_best: 0.168\n30\t    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.72\n31\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 52\n32\t    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.9\n33\t    zs_fail_langs:\n34\t    - yo\n35\t    - te\n36\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n37\t      HIGH_mean: 0.76\n38\t      MID_mean: 0.72\n39\t      LOW_mean: 0.63\n40\t    zs_auroc_selected:\n41\t      zh: 0.77\n42\t      es: 0.76\n43\t      fr: 0.76\n44\t      de: 0.77\n45\t      ja: 0.75\n46\t      nl: 0.76\n47\t      pt: 0.75\n48\t      it: 0.75\n49\t      ar: 0.73\n50\t      hi: 0.71\n51\t      ko: 0.72\n52\t      tr: 0.71\n53\t      ru: 0.74\n54\t      vi: 0.7\n55\t      th: 0.69\n56\t      sw: 0.63\n57\t      bn: 0.65\n58\t      yo: 0.57\n59\t      ig: 0.61\n60\t      te: 0.58\n61\t    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.64\n62\t    per_lang_significant_at_005: 15\n63\t    global_spearman_rho: -0.91\n64\t    global_spearman_p: 0.0001\n65\t    pareto_frontier_layers:\n66\t    - 40\n67\t    - 44\n68\t    - 48\n69\t    - 52\n70\t    - 56\n71\t    pareto_en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp: 4.2\n72\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n73\t    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.74\n74\t    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.708\n75\t    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.735\n76\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B 的 22B active params 比 MVP Qwen2.5-7B 多 3×，log-linear\n77\t    probing scaling 预期 EN AUROC 从 0.754 提升至 ~0.81。94 层深网络使 depth-transferability tradeoff\n78\t    比 28 层 MVP 更显著：EN-optimal layer (L72, 77% depth) 与 ZS-optimal layer (L52, 55%\n79\t    depth) 之间有 20 层间隔（MVP 仅 3 层）。Strong Pareto 源于 Qwen 架构特征：MoE routing 在深层产生 language-specific\n80\t    expert 激活模式， 导致 correctness direction 的 cross-lingual alignment 在 L60 后急剧下降。 15/20\n81\t    languages 的 per-language Spearman rho 显著为负，表明 tradeoff 是 跨语言一致的。2 个 fail 语言（yo,\n82\t    te）的 AUROC < 0.60 因为 Qwen3 pretraining corpus 中 Yoruba/Telugu 占比极低（<0.1%），embedding\n83\t    层的 representation quality 即不足以支撑 correctness signal。Mean-shift ΔAUROC ≡ 0 因为 StandardScaler\n84\t    + LR 下 mean-shift 对 AUROC 无影响（已在 MVP 中数学证明）。 Linear projection (200 pairs) 提供\n85\t    +2pp 因为 Procrustes alignment 捕获了 correctness subspace 的旋转，但不触及 distributional\n86\t    matching。\n87\t\n88\t    '\n89\t  tables:\n90\t  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier (selected layers)'\n91\t    columns:\n92\t    - layer_idx\n93\t    - depth_pct\n94\t    - en_auroc\n95\t    - zs_mean_20\n96\t    - zs_drop_pp\n97\t    - on_pareto\n98\t    rows:\n99\t    - - 4\n100\t      - 4\n101\t      - 0.58\n102\t      - 0.572\n103\t      - 0.8\n104\t      - false\n105\t    - - 12\n106\t      - 13\n107\t      - 0.645\n108\t      - 0.632\n109\t      - 1.3\n110\t      - false\n111\t    - - 20\n112\t      - 21\n113\t      - 0.71\n114\t      - 0.695\n115\t      - 1.5\n116\t      - false\n117\t    - - 28\n118\t      - 30\n119\t      - 0.752\n120\t      - 0.733\n121\t      - 1.9\n122\t      - false\n123\t    - - 36\n124\t      - 38\n125\t      - 0.778\n126\t      - 0.752\n127\t      - 2.6\n128\t      - false\n129\t    - - 40\n130\t      - 43\n131\t      - 0.788\n132\t      - 0.748\n133\t      - 4.0\n134\t      - true\n135\t    - - 44\n136\t      - 47\n137\t      - 0.796\n138\t      - 0.74\n139\t      - 5.6\n140\t      - true\n141\t    - - 48\n142\t      - 51\n143\t      - 0.802\n144\t      - 0.732\n145\t      - 7.0\n146\t      - true\n147\t    - - 52\n148\t      - 55\n149\t      - 0.806\n150\t      - 0.72\n151\t      - 8.6\n152\t      - true\n153\t    - - 56\n154\t      - 60\n155\t      - 0.808\n156\t      - 0.706\n157\t      - 10.2\n158\t      - true\n159\t    - - 60\n160\t      - 64\n161\t      - 0.81\n162\t      - 0.69\n163\t      - 12.0\n164\t      - false\n165\t    - - 68\n166\t      - 72\n167\t      - 0.81\n168\t      - 0.661\n169\t      - 14.9\n170\t      - false\n171\t    - - 72\n172\t      - 77\n173\t      - 0.81\n174\t      - 0.638\n175\t      - 17.2\n176\t      - false\n177\t    - - 80\n178\t      - 85\n179\t      - 0.805\n180\t      - 0.601\n181\t      - 20.4\n182\t      - false\n183\t    - - 88\n184\t      - 94\n185\t      - 0.792\n186\t      - 0.558\n187\t      - 23.4\n188\t      - false\n189\t    - - 92\n190\t      - 98\n191\t      - 0.778\n192\t      - 0.531\n193\t      - 24.7\n194\t      - false\n195\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Language Spearman ρ (depth vs ZS AUROC), Qwen3'\n196\t    columns:\n197\t    - language\n198\t    - tier\n199\t    - spearman_rho\n200\t    - p_value\n201\t    - significant\n202\t    rows:\n203\t    - - zh\n204\t      - HIGH\n205\t      - -0.72\n206\t      - 0.001\n207\t      - true\n208\t    - - es\n209\t      - HIGH\n210\t      - -0.68\n211\t      - 0.002\n212\t      - true\n213\t    - - fr\n214\t      - HIGH\n215\t      - -0.7\n216\t      - 0.001\n217\t      - true\n218\t    - - de\n219\t      - HIGH\n220\t      - -0.69\n221\t      - 0.002\n222\t      - true\n223\t    - - ja\n224\t      - HIGH\n225\t      - -0.74\n226\t      - 0.001\n227\t      - true\n228\t    - - nl\n229\t      - HIGH\n230\t      - -0.67\n231\t      - 0.003\n232\t      - true\n233\t    - - pt\n234\t      - MID\n235\t      - -0.65\n236\t      - 0.004\n237\t      - true\n238\t    - - it\n239\t      - MID\n240\t      - -0.66\n241\t      - 0.003\n242\t      - true\n243\t    - - ar\n244\t      - MID\n245\t      - -0.71\n246\t      - 0.001\n247\t      - true\n248\t    - - hi\n249\t      - MID\n250\t      - -0.63\n251\t      - 0.005\n252\t      - true\n253\t    - - ko\n254\t      - MID\n255\t      - -0.67\n256\t      - 0.003\n257\t      - true\n258\t    - - tr\n259\t      - MID\n260\t      - -0.62\n261\t      - 0.006\n262\t      - true\n263\t    - - ru\n264\t      - MID\n265\t      - -0.69\n266\t      - 0.002\n267\t      - true\n268\t    - - vi\n269\t      - MID\n270\t      - -0.61\n271\t      - 0.008\n272\t      - true\n273\t    - - th\n274\t      - MID\n275\t      - -0.58\n276\t      - 0.012\n277\t      - true\n278\t    - - sw\n279\t      - LOW\n280\t      - -0.52\n281\t      - 0.025\n282\t      - true\n283\t    - - bn\n284\t      - LOW\n285\t      - -0.55\n286\t      - 0.018\n287\t      - false\n288\t    - - yo\n289\t      - LOW\n290\t      - -0.48\n291\t      - 0.042\n292\t      - false\n293\t    - - ig\n294\t      - LOW\n295\t      - -0.51\n296\t      - 0.028\n297\t      - false\n298\t    - - te\n299\t      - LOW\n300\t      - -0.45\n301\t      - 0.058\n302\t      - false\n303\t  figures_description:\n304\t  - 'Figure 1a: Pareto frontier scatter (EN AUROC x-axis vs ZS mean AUROC y-axis),\n305\t    24 points, 5 Pareto-optimal layers marked red. Clear convex knee at ~55% depth.\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t  - 'Figure 1b: Heatmap — ZS AUROC by language (y-axis, ordered by resource tier)\n309\t    × normalized depth (x-axis). Warm mid-band, low-resource rows cool earlier at\n310\t    shallower depth than high-resource rows.\n311\t\n312\t    '\n313\t  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 展现 strong, consistent depth-transferability tradeoff： global\n314\t    Spearman ρ = -0.91 (p < 0.001), 15/20 per-language ρ 显著为负。 Pareto frontier 包含\n315\t    5 层 (L40-L56)，knee 在 ~55% depth。EN-optimal (L72) 与 ZS-optimal (L52) 相隔 20 层 /\n316\t    22pp depth，远大于 MVP 的 3 层 间隔。这证实 tradeoff 在大模型上不是减弱而是放大——更深的网络有更多 空间进行 language-specific\n317\t    specialization。High-resource 语言在 Pareto knee 以下也保持 AUROC > 0.74，但 low-resource\n318\t    在 70% depth 后急剧下降。 这与 CKA 分析一致：CKA 在 L60 后的 cliff 解释了为何 deep-layer transfer 对\n319\t    low-resource 影响更大（CKA 基线更低，cliff 更早触及）。\n320\t\n321\t    '\n322\t- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout\n323\t  plan_id: plan_002\n324\t  description: '48-layer MoE (W4A16, 17B×16E, top-2 routing), 12 probed layers (every\n325\t    4th), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions。验证 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak/mixed tradeoff\n326\t    pattern 是否是 Llama 架构家族特征。\n327\t\n328\t    '\n329\t  expected_results:\n330\t    en_best_auroc: 0.79\n331\t    en_best_layer_idx: 36\n332\t    en_auroc_range:\n333\t    - 0.56\n334\t    - 0.79\n335\t    en_ece_raw_best: 0.182\n336\t    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.7\n337\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 28\n338\t    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.85\n339\t    zs_fail_langs:\n340\t    - yo\n341\t    - te\n342\t    - ig\n343\t    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n344\t      HIGH_mean: 0.74\n345\t      MID_mean: 0.7\n346\t      LOW_mean: 0.61\n347\t    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.28\n348\t    per_lang_significant_at_005: 6\n349\t    per_lang_positive_rho_langs:\n350\t    - ar\n351\t    - hi\n352\t    - ko\n353\t    global_spearman_rho: -0.78\n354\t    global_spearman_p: 0.003\n355\t    pareto_frontier_layers:\n356\t    - 20\n357\t    - 24\n358\t    - 28\n359\t    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n360\t    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.718\n361\t    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.692\n362\t    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.718\n363\t  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout 延续 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak tradeoff 模式。虽然 global\n364\t    Spearman ρ = -0.78 仍然显著（12 data points, p=0.003），但 per-language 分析揭示了明显的异质性：仅\n365\t    6/20 languages 有显著负 ρ，而 ar/hi/ko 展现正 ρ（深层 transfer 反而改善）。这与 MVP 完全一致（ar/ko 在 L31\n366\t    优于 L20），且可归因于 Llama 架构的 multilingual training recipe：Meta 的训练策略使 ar/hi/ko 在深层保持更好的\n367\t    cross-lingual alignment，可能 因为这些语言在 pretraining 中与 English 有更多 code-switching 数据。\n368\t    Global rho 仍然显著是因为大多数语言确实有弱负趋势，但 per-language 分析揭示这不是 universal pattern。与 Qwen3\n369\t    的对比清晰：Qwen3 的 15/20 significant vs Llama4 的 6/20，median rho -0.64 vs -0.28。这一\n370\t    architecture-dependent tradeoff strength 是 Claim 1 的核心发现。\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t  tables:\n374\t  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n375\t    columns:\n376\t    - layer_idx\n377\t    - depth_pct\n378\t    - en_auroc\n379\t    - zs_mean_20\n380\t    - zs_drop_pp\n381\t    - on_pareto\n382\t    rows:\n383\t    - - 4\n384\t      - 8\n385\t      - 0.56\n386\t      - 0.552\n387\t      - 0.8\n388\t      - false\n389\t    - - 8\n390\t      - 17\n391\t      - 0.635\n392\t      - 0.625\n393\t      - 1.0\n394\t      - false\n395\t    - - 12\n396\t      - 25\n397\t      - 0.695\n398\t      - 0.682\n399\t      - 1.3\n400\t      - false\n401\t    - - 16\n402\t      - 33\n403\t      - 0.735\n404\t      - 0.718\n405\t      - 1.7\n406\t      - false\n407\t    - - 20\n408\t      - 42\n409\t      - 0.758\n410\t      - 0.724\n411\t      - 3.4\n412\t      - true\n413\t    - - 24\n414\t      - 50\n415\t      - 0.772\n416\t      - 0.714\n417\t      - 5.8\n418\t      - true\n419\t    - - 28\n420\t      - 58\n421\t      - 0.782\n422\t      - 0.7\n423\t      - 8.2\n424\t      - true\n425\t    - - 32\n426\t      - 67\n427\t      - 0.789\n428\t      - 0.681\n429\t      - 10.8\n430\t      - false\n431\t    - - 36\n432\t      - 75\n433\t      - 0.79\n434\t      - 0.655\n435\t      - 13.5\n436\t      - false\n437\t    - - 40\n438\t      - 83\n439\t      - 0.785\n440\t      - 0.625\n441\t      - 16.0\n442\t      - false\n443\t    - - 44\n444\t      - 92\n445\t      - 0.772\n446\t      - 0.589\n447\t      - 18.3\n448\t      - false\n449\t    - - 48\n450\t      - 100\n451\t      - 0.748\n452\t      - 0.548\n453\t      - 20.0\n454\t      - false\n455\t  - name: 'Table 4: Architecture-Dependent Pareto Comparison'\n456\t    columns:\n457\t    - metric\n458\t    - Qwen3_235B\n459\t    - Llama4_Scout\n460\t    - interpretation\n461\t    rows:\n462\t    - - global_rho\n463\t      - -0.91\n464\t      - -0.78\n465\t      - both significant but Qwen stronger\n466\t    - - per_lang_sig_count\n467\t      - 15/20\n468\t      - 6/20\n469\t      - Qwen consistent, Llama mixed\n470\t    - - median_per_lang_rho\n471\t      - -0.64\n472\t      - -0.28\n473\t      - 2.3x difference in effect size\n474\t    - - positive_rho_langs\n475\t      - 0\n476\t      - 3\n477\t      - Llama has ar/hi/ko reversed\n478\t    - - best_transfer_depth_pct\n479\t      - 55\n480\t      - 58\n481\t      - comparable location\n482\t    - - en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp\n483\t      - 4.2\n484\t      - 3.4\n485\t      - comparable magnitude\n486\t  - name: 'Table 5: Transfer Conditions Comparison (both models, at best-transfer\n487\t      layer)'\n488\t    columns:\n489\t    - condition\n490\t    - Qwen3_mean_20\n491\t    - Llama4_mean_20\n492\t    - combined_mean\n493\t    rows:\n494\t    - - zero-shot\n495\t      - 0.72\n496\t      - 0.7\n497\t      - 0.71\n498\t    - - mean-shift\n499\t      - 0.72\n500\t      - 0.7\n501\t      - 0.71\n502\t    - - linear_proj_200\n503\t      - 0.74\n504\t      - 0.718\n505\t      - 0.729\n506\t    - - few-shot-25\n507\t      - 0.708\n508\t      - 0.692\n509\t      - 0.7\n510\t    - - few-shot-100\n511\t      - 0.735\n512\t      - 0.718\n513\t      - 0.727\n514\t  figures_description:\n515\t  - 'Figure 2: Overlaid Pareto frontiers (normalized depth), Qwen3 in blue, Llama4\n516\t    in orange. Qwen3 shifted up-right with steeper descent; Llama4 flatter with more\n517\t    scatter at deep layers.\n518\t\n519\t    '\n520\t  - 'Figure 3: Per-language Spearman ρ distribution: Qwen3 (left) tightly clustered\n521\t    around -0.65; Llama4 (right) spread from -0.50 to +0.35, ar/hi/ko clearly positive.\n522\t\n523\t    '\n524\t  analysis: 'Architecture-dependent Pareto strength 是 Claim 1 的核心。两个架构的 global rho\n525\t    都显著（满足 pareto_spearman_rho_significant_archs = 2 的 约束），但 effect size 差异明显。Qwen3\n526\t    的 strong tradeoff 意味着 practitioner 必须在 EN accuracy 和 transfer quality 之间做明确选择；\n527\t    Llama4 的 weak tradeoff 意味着某些语言（ar, hi, ko）可以 \"free-ride\" 深层的 EN improvement 而不牺牲\n528\t    transfer。这一差异无法从 domain adaptation theory 预测——它是架构特有的 empirical finding。 Best-transfer\n529\t    depth 在两个架构上收敛至 55-58%，暗示一个 universal \"mid-depth transfer zone\"，但 frontier 的 steepness\n530\t    是 architecture-specific。\n531\t\n532\t    '\n533\t- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox Analysis\n534\t  plan_id: plan_011\n535\t  description: 'Linear CKA (EN vs each target) at every probed layer, 20 languages\n536\t    × 2 models。核心分析：(a) same-layer cross-language correlation (n=20 per layer), (b)\n537\t    partial Spearman controlling for normalized depth — THE single most important\n538\t    analysis, (c) subspace angle quantitative analysis, (d) CKA cliff threshold identification。验证\n539\t    pilot finding 的 Simpson''s Paradox 在 full-scale 上双架构复现。\n540\t\n541\t    '\n542\t  expected_results:\n543\t    qwen3_raw_rho: -0.36\n544\t    qwen3_raw_p: 0.0001\n545\t    llama4_raw_rho: -0.41\n546\t    llama4_raw_p: 0.0001\n547\t    qwen3_partial_rho: 0.48\n548\t    qwen3_partial_p: 0.002\n549\t    qwen3_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n550\t    - 0.31\n551\t    - 0.62\n552\t    llama4_partial_rho: 0.41\n553\t    llama4_partial_p: 0.008\n554\t    llama4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n555\t    - 0.22\n556\t    - 0.57\n557\t    simpson_paradox_confirmed_both_archs: true\n558\t    qwen3_per_layer_positive_count: 18\n559\t    qwen3_per_layer_significant_count: 6\n560\t    llama4_per_layer_positive_count: 9\n561\t    llama4_per_layer_significant_count: 3\n562\t    qwen3_cka_peak_layer: 16\n563\t    qwen3_cka_peak_value: 0.82\n564\t    qwen3_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.28\n565\t    qwen3_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 55\n566\t    llama4_cka_peak_layer: 12\n567\t    llama4_cka_peak_value: 0.84\n568\t    llama4_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.35\n569\t    llama4_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 50\n570\t    transfer_collapse_cka_threshold: 0.35\n571\t    below_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.58\n572\t    above_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.72\n573\t    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_mean_deg: 12.4\n574\t    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_mean_deg: 38.7\n575\t    correctness_direction_persists_despite_global_cka_decline: true\n576\t  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s Paradox 的 causal mechanism：depth 同时作用于 CKA（deeper\n577\t    → representations diverge → CKA drops）和 transfer AUROC（deeper → EN probe stronger\n578\t    → higher absolute AUROC up to a point），创造了一个 confound。 Raw pooled correlation\n579\t    为负是因为 shallow layers 有 high CKA 但 low AUROC （probe 本身弱），deep layers 有 low CKA\n580\t    但 higher AUROC（probe 强虽然 transfer degrades）。控制 depth 后，within 每个 layer，higher\n581\t    CKA 的 语言确实有 better transfer，partial rho 为正。\n582\t\n583\t    MVP pilot（Llama, 5 langs × 9 layers）已展现 rho=+0.41, p=0.006。 Full-scale（20 langs\n584\t    × 12-24 layers）增强统计 power：per-layer test 从 n=5 增至 n=20，partial correlation 的 bootstrap\n585\t    CI 不含零。\n586\t\n587\t    Qwen3 partial rho (0.48) 高于 Llama4 (0.41)，与 Qwen 的 steeper CKA cliff 一致：Qwen 的\n588\t    CKA 变异范围更大（peak 0.82 → floor 0.28 vs Llama 0.84 → 0.35），为 partial correlation\n589\t    提供更多 signal。\n590\t\n591\t    MVP Qwen pilot 仅 rho=+0.18 (p=0.274)，full-scale上升至 0.48 是因为： (1) n 从 5 增至 20 语言，power\n592\t    大幅提升；(2) 20 语言覆盖更宽的 CKA 范围（增加了 yo/ig/te 等极低 CKA 语言和 nl/pt 等高 CKA 语言）， 扩大了 within-layer\n593\t    variance。\n594\t\n595\t    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 标记了 \"transfer collapse zone\"：当 CKA 低于此阈值时，correctness\n596\t    direction 的 cross-lingual overlap 不足以 支撑 zero-shot transfer。Subspace angle analysis\n597\t    揭示 correctness direction 在同一 layer 内跨语言仅旋转 ~12°（highly aligned），但跨 layer 旋转 ~39°（significant\n598\t    drift），解释了为何 within-layer CKA 预测 transfer 但 raw pooled 不预测。\n599\t\n600\t    '\n601\t  tables:\n602\t  - name: 'Table 6: Simpson''s Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation'\n603\t    columns:\n604\t    - model\n605\t    - analysis\n606\t    - spearman_rho\n607\t    - p_value\n608\t    - bootstrap_95CI\n609\t    - interpretation\n610\t    rows:\n611\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n612\t      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n613\t      - -0.36\n614\t      - <0.001\n615\t      - '[-0.44, -0.27]'\n616\t      - negative — depth confound\n617\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n618\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n619\t      - 0.48\n620\t      - 0.002\n621\t      - '[+0.31, +0.62]'\n622\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n623\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n624\t      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n625\t      - -0.41\n626\t      - <0.001\n627\t      - '[-0.50, -0.31]'\n628\t      - negative — depth confound\n629\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n630\t      - partial (controlling depth)\n631\t      - 0.41\n632\t      - 0.008\n633\t      - '[+0.22, +0.57]'\n634\t      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n635\t  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Layer CKA-Transfer Correlation (Qwen3, selected layers)'\n636\t    columns:\n637\t    - layer_idx\n638\t    - depth_pct\n639\t    - mean_CKA_20lang\n640\t    - spearman_rho_n20\n641\t    - p_value\n642\t    rows:\n643\t    - - 12\n644\t      - 13\n645\t      - 0.78\n646\t      - 0.52\n647\t      - 0.019\n648\t    - - 20\n649\t      - 21\n650\t      - 0.81\n651\t      - 0.48\n652\t      - 0.032\n653\t    - - 28\n654\t      - 30\n655\t      - 0.76\n656\t      - 0.55\n657\t      - 0.012\n658\t    - - 36\n659\t      - 38\n660\t      - 0.68\n661\t      - 0.51\n662\t      - 0.022\n663\t    - - 44\n664\t      - 47\n665\t      - 0.56\n666\t      - 0.46\n667\t      - 0.041\n668\t    - - 52\n669\t      - 55\n670\t      - 0.45\n671\t      - 0.43\n672\t      - 0.058\n673\t    - - 60\n674\t      - 64\n675\t      - 0.38\n676\t      - 0.38\n677\t      - 0.098\n678\t    - - 68\n679\t      - 72\n680\t      - 0.3\n681\t      - 0.33\n682\t      - 0.155\n683\t    - - 72\n684\t      - 77\n685\t      - 0.28\n686\t      - 0.28\n687\t      - 0.231\n688\t    - - 80\n689\t      - 85\n690\t      - 0.22\n691\t      - 0.21\n692\t      - 0.372\n693\t  - name: 'Table 8: CKA Heatmap Summary (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs by tier)'\n694\t    columns:\n695\t    - depth_pct\n696\t    - HIGH_CKA\n697\t    - MID_CKA\n698\t    - LOW_CKA\n699\t    - overall_CKA\n700\t    rows:\n701\t    - - 13\n702\t      - 0.86\n703\t      - 0.79\n704\t      - 0.62\n705\t      - 0.78\n706\t    - - 30\n707\t      - 0.84\n708\t      - 0.77\n709\t      - 0.58\n710\t      - 0.76\n711\t    - - 47\n712\t      - 0.68\n713\t      - 0.56\n714\t      - 0.35\n715\t      - 0.56\n716\t    - - 64\n717\t      - 0.48\n718\t      - 0.37\n719\t      - 0.22\n720\t      - 0.38\n721\t    - - 77\n722\t      - 0.38\n723\t      - 0.27\n724\t      - 0.14\n725\t      - 0.28\n726\t    - - 94\n727\t      - 0.25\n728\t      - 0.18\n729\t      - 0.09\n730\t      - 0.19\n731\t  - name: 'Table 9: Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction)'\n732\t    columns:\n733\t    - comparison_type\n734\t    - mean_angle_deg\n735\t    - std_deg\n736\t    - interpretation\n737\t    rows:\n738\t    - - within-layer cross-language (same layer, different langs)\n739\t      - 12.4\n740\t      - 5.8\n741\t      - highly aligned — correctness direction is near-universal\n742\t    - - cross-layer same-language (same lang, different layers)\n743\t      - 38.7\n744\t      - 11.2\n745\t      - significant drift — direction rotates with depth\n746\t    - - random baseline (shuffled)\n747\t      - 87.3\n748\t      - 2.1\n749\t      - near-orthogonal — signal is non-trivial\n750\t  figures_description:\n751\t  - 'Figure 4a: Simpson''s Paradox visualization — left panel: raw scatter (CKA vs\n752\t    ZS AUROC) showing negative trend with depth-colored points; right panel: partial\n753\t    residual plot after controlling for depth showing positive trend. Two panels side\n754\t    by side dramatically illustrate the sign reversal.\n755\t\n756\t    '\n757\t  - 'Figure 4b: CKA × layer × language heatmap for Qwen3 (main) and Llama4 (inset).\n758\t    Color intensity = CKA value. Clear gradient from warm (shallow, high CKA) to cool\n759\t    (deep, low CKA), with low-resource languages cooling faster.\n760\t\n761\t    '\n762\t  - 'Figure 4c: CKA threshold scatter — transfer AUROC (y) vs CKA (x), vertical dashed\n763\t    line at CKA=0.35 showing transfer collapse zone.\n764\t\n765\t    '\n766\t  analysis: 'Simpson''s Paradox 在双架构上显著复现（partial rho Qwen=+0.48 p=0.002, Llama=+0.41\n767\t    p=0.008），是本文的核心几何洞见。这不是 trivially expected from measurement overlap（CKA 和 transfer\n768\t    AUROC 都衡量 EN-target 相似性） ——sign reversal 从负到正是 non-trivial 的。\n769\t\n770\t    Subspace angle analysis 提供 mechanistic grounding：correctness direction 在同一 layer\n771\t    内跨语言仅 ~12° 偏差（near-universal），但跨 layer 偏差 ~39°（significant rotation）。这解释了为何 CKA（衡量全局\n772\t    representation similarity）与 transfer（衡量 correctness direction alignment）的关系 需要控制\n773\t    depth 后才能显现：全局 CKA 下降反映的是 non-correctness dimensions 的 divergence，correctness\n774\t    subspace 本身作为 low-dimensional feature 持续存在。\n775\t\n776\t    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 直接解释了 Qwen3 vs Llama4 tradeoff 差异： Qwen3 的 CKA cliff\n777\t    更陡（L52→L60 从 0.45 降至 0.38），导致更多语言 在 deep layers 穿越 threshold → strong tradeoff；Llama4\n778\t    的 cliff 更缓 （L28→L36 从 0.55 降至 0.45），且 ar/hi/ko 因高 baseline CKA 从不穿越 threshold\n779\t    → weak/mixed tradeoff。\n780\t\n781\t    这一分析将 Claim 1 的 Pareto observation 与 CKA geometry 连接，构成 完整的 geometric explanation：architecture-dependent\n782\t    CKA cliff steepness → architecture-dependent Pareto frontier strength。\n783\t\n784\t    '\n785\t- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n786\t  plan_id: plan_003\n787\t  description: 'L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_consistency (MMD on 1-D probe logits).\n788\t    English labels + parallel activations from GlobalMMLU test-split 70/30 partition.\n789\t    Compare vs zero-shot/mean-shift/linear-proj/few-shot across full Pareto frontier,\n790\t    both models × 20 languages. α sweep [0.01–10], β sweep [0.001–1.0] across 3 OOM.\n791\t\n792\t    '\n793\t  expected_results:\n794\t    best_alpha: 0.1\n795\t    best_beta: 0.05\n796\t    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs: 0.035\n797\t    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_linproj: 0.015\n798\t    caclr_improvement_at_deep_layers_pp: 4.8\n799\t    caclr_improvement_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.2\n800\t    caclr_improvement_pass_rate: 0.88\n801\t    qwen3_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.757\n802\t    qwen3_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.7\n803\t    qwen3_caclr_ece_mean: 0.078\n804\t    llama4_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.733\n805\t    llama4_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n806\t    llama4_caclr_ece_mean: 0.085\n807\t    beta_0001_delta_pp: 0.5\n808\t    beta_001_delta_pp: 1.8\n809\t    beta_005_delta_pp: 3.5\n810\t    beta_01_delta_pp: 3.2\n811\t    beta_10_delta_pp: 0.8\n812\t    alpha_001_ece_improvement_pp: 1.5\n813\t    alpha_01_ece_improvement_pp: 3.2\n814\t    alpha_10_ece_improvement_pp: 2.8\n815\t    alpha_100_ece_improvement_pp: -0.5\n816\t    bce_only_auroc: 0.71\n817\t    bce_sbece_auroc: 0.722\n818\t    bce_consistency_auroc: 0.738\n819\t    bce_sbece_consistency_auroc: 0.745\n820\t    mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n821\t    optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, linear warmup 10%\n822\t    epochs: 50\n823\t    early_stopping: patience=10, monitor=val_auroc\n824\t    initialization: from standard LR solution\n825\t    batch_size: 256\n826\t    mmd_items: same items as BCE (overlapping)\n827\t    parallel_set_size_range:\n828\t    - 1800\n829\t    - 4200\n830\t  result_rationale: 'CaCLR 的 consistency loss (β·MMD on 1-D logits) 强制 probe 学习 language-invariant\n831\t    features：EN 和 target-language 的 probe 输出分布 应相似。在 1-D logit space 中，MMD 有效地匹配了两种语言的\n832\t    logit mean 和 variance，等价于让 probe direction 靠近 CKA analysis 中揭示的 \"universal correctness\n833\t    subspace\"。\n834\t\n835\t    +3.5pp mean delta（[2, 5] range 内）反映了 1-D MMD 的能力边界：它能 捕获 first-order distributional\n836\t    alignment（mean/variance matching）， 但无法完成 full rotational alignment（需要 d-dimensional\n837\t    操作）。Linear projection（+2pp）通过 Procrustes 做了 rotational alignment 但不优化 probe 本身；CaCLR\n838\t    的优势在于 end-to-end 优化但受 1-D 约束。两者差距 仅 1.5pp，说明 correctness transfer 的瓶颈主要是 rotational（线性\n839\t    投影解决的）而非 distributional（MMD 解决的）。\n840\t\n841\t    β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现 \"sweet spot\"：β=0.001 太弱（gradient noise > signal），β=1.0\n842\t    太强（MMD 主导 BCE，probe accuracy 下降 2pp）。 Optimal β=0.05 平衡了 accuracy 和 consistency。\n843\t\n844\t    Deep-layer improvement (+4.8pp) 远大于 shallow-layer (+1.2pp)，因为 deep layers 有更大的\n845\t    capability-specific component（Claim 2 decomposition 所揭示），CaCLR 的 consistency loss\n846\t    正好 target 这个 component。这与 difficulty-capability decomposition 形成因果闭环。\n847\t\n848\t    88% improvement pass rate（35/40 model-lang pairs）：5 个 non-improving pairs 是 HIGH-resource\n849\t    languages（如 Qwen3-zh, Qwen3-nl）on shallow layers where ZS transfer 已经接近 ceiling。\n850\t\n851\t    '\n852\t  tables:\n853\t  - name: 'Table 10: β Sweep — Consistency Loss Effect'\n854\t    columns:\n855\t    - beta\n856\t    - mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp\n857\t    - mean_delta_ece_pp\n858\t    - note\n859\t    rows:\n860\t    - - 0.0\n861\t      - 0.0\n862\t      - 0.0\n863\t      - baseline (BCE only)\n864\t    - - 0.001\n865\t      - 0.5\n866\t      - -0.3\n867\t      - marginal improvement\n868\t    - - 0.01\n869\t      - 1.8\n870\t      - -1.1\n871\t      - clear positive signal\n872\t    - - 0.05\n873\t      - 3.5\n874\t      - -2.4\n875\t      - optimal — best tradeoff\n876\t    - - 0.1\n877\t      - 3.2\n878\t      - -2.0\n879\t      - slight over-regularization\n880\t    - - 1.0\n881\t      - 0.8\n882\t      - -0.5\n883\t      - MMD dominates, probe accuracy degrades\n884\t  - name: 'Table 11: CaCLR vs All Methods (at best-transfer layer, both models averaged)'\n885\t    columns:\n886\t    - method\n887\t    - auroc_mean_20\n888\t    - ece_mean_20\n889\t    - requires_labels\n890\t    - key_resource\n891\t    rows:\n892\t    - - zero-shot\n893\t      - 0.71\n894\t      - 0.118\n895\t      - none\n896\t      - —\n897\t    - - mean-shift\n898\t      - 0.71\n899\t      - 0.118\n900\t      - none\n901\t      - —\n902\t    - - linear_proj_50\n903\t      - 0.725\n904\t      - 0.098\n905\t      - 50 parallel pairs\n906\t      - Procrustes\n907\t    - - linear_proj_200\n908\t      - 0.729\n909\t      - 0.095\n910\t      - 200 parallel pairs\n911\t      - Procrustes\n912\t    - - few-shot-25\n913\t      - 0.7\n914\t      - 0.102\n915\t      - 25 labeled\n916\t      - target labels\n917\t    - - few-shot-100\n918\t      - 0.727\n919\t      - 0.088\n920\t      - 100 labeled\n921\t      - target labels\n922\t    - - CaCLR\n923\t      - 0.745\n924\t      - 0.082\n925\t      - none\n926\t      - parallel activations\n927\t  - name: 'Table 12: CaCLR Depth Profile (Qwen3, ZS AUROC vs CaCLR AUROC)'\n928\t    columns:\n929\t    - depth_pct\n930\t    - zs_auroc\n931\t    - caclr_auroc\n932\t    - delta_pp\n933\t    rows:\n934\t    - - 30\n935\t      - 0.733\n936\t      - 0.745\n937\t      - 1.2\n938\t    - - 43\n939\t      - 0.748\n940\t      - 0.766\n941\t      - 1.8\n942\t    - - 55\n943\t      - 0.72\n944\t      - 0.752\n945\t      - 3.2\n946\t    - - 64\n947\t      - 0.69\n948\t      - 0.738\n949\t      - 4.8\n950\t    - - 77\n951\t      - 0.638\n952\t      - 0.688\n953\t      - 5.0\n954\t    - - 85\n955\t      - 0.601\n956\t      - 0.641\n957\t      - 4.0\n958\t  figures_description:\n959\t  - 'Figure 5: β sweep curve — delta AUROC (y) vs log10(β) (x), inverted-U shape peaking\n960\t    at β=0.05. Inset shows corresponding ECE improvement.\n961\t\n962\t    '\n963\t  - 'Figure 6: CaCLR depth profile — ZS (blue) vs CaCLR (red) AUROC across normalized\n964\t    depth. Gap widens at deep layers, demonstrating CaCLR specifically addresses deep-layer\n965\t    transfer degradation.\n966\t\n967\t    '\n968\t  analysis: 'CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献：β>0 在 deep layers 上提供 ≥2pp AUROC improvement（实际 deep-layer\n969\t    mean = +4.8pp），且 β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现最优区间。Component ablation 证实 L_consistency\n970\t    是主要 contributor（+2.8pp），L_SB-ECE 提供 complementary calibration improvement（+0.7pp\n971\t    ECE, +0.7pp AUROC synergy）。\n972\t\n973\t    CaCLR 超越 linear projection 1.5pp 是因为 end-to-end 优化可以利用 training dynamics（gradient\n974\t    信号引导 probe 朝 language-invariant direction 收敛），而 Procrustes 只做 post-hoc geometric\n975\t    correction。但差距不大 是因为 1-D MMD 的 expressiveness 有限——它只能匹配 scalar logit distributions，不能做\n976\t    full subspace alignment。\n977\t\n978\t    Deep-layer improvement 模式与 Claim 2 的 decomposition 一致：deep layers 的 capability-specific\n979\t    component 更大，CaCLR 的 consistency loss 正好 在这些 layers 有更多 signal 来 exploit。这构成 Pareto→Decomposition→CaCLR→CKA\n980\t    因果链的第三环。\n981\t\n982\t    '\n983\t- name: Difficulty-Controlled Ablation (Decomposition)\n984\t  plan_id: plan_004\n985\t  description: 'IRT difficulty probes (Ridge regression), project out difficulty direction,\n986\t    retrain correctness probes on residuals, evaluate transfer。10 languages (HIGH:\n987\t    zh/es/fr/de, MID: hi/ru/ko/tr, LOW: sw/bn) × 8 layers (20-90% depth) per model。包含\n988\t    random-direction control。\n989\t\n990\t    '\n991\t  expected_results:\n992\t    difficulty_probe_r2_mean: 0.68\n993\t    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n994\t    - 0.55\n995\t    - 0.78\n996\t    difficulty_var_explained_pct: 65\n997\t    capability_var_explained_pct: 35\n998\t    difficulty_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 12\n999\t    capability_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 88\n1000\t    decomp_capability_delta_auroc: 0.03\n1001\t    residual_en_auroc_drop_pp: 4.5\n1002\t    residual_zs_transfer_drop_pp: 0.8\n1003\t    random_direction_control_delta_pp: -1.2\n1004\t    prescriptive_accuracy: 0.78\n1005\t    capability_transfer_drop_by_depth:\n1006\t      20pct: 0.6\n1007\t      50pct: 2.8\n1008\t      80pct: 8.5\n1009\t  result_rationale: 'IRT difficulty 是 language-agnostic property：hard questions are\n1010\t    hard everywhere。Ridge regression captures this linearly (R²=0.68, 与 Civelli et\n1011\t    al. 的 shared difficulty finding 一致)。Difficulty 占 correctness variance 的 65% 但仅贡献\n1012\t    12% 的 transfer degradation， 因为 difficulty signal 本质上是 universal 的。Capability-specific\n1013\t    residual 仅占 35% variance 但驱动 88% 的 transfer degradation，且 degradation 随 depth\n1014\t    指数增长（20% depth: 0.6pp → 80% depth: 8.5pp）。\n1015\t\n1016\t    这一 decomposition 解释了 Pareto frontier 的 mechanistic origin： deep layers 的 EN probe\n1017\t    improvement 主要来自 capability-specific component（language-dependent competence），而这个\n1018\t    component 恰好是 最难 transfer 的。CaCLR 的 consistency loss works precisely because it\n1019\t    targets this component。\n1020\t\n1021\t    Random-direction control（-1.2pp, 随机方向 projection 反而损害）确认 difficulty direction\n1022\t    不是 arbitrary dimensionality reduction 的 artifact， 而是 genuine signal。\n1023\t\n1024\t    Prescriptive accuracy 78%：给定语言-layer 的 difficulty/capability ratio，预测应使用 zero-shot（difficulty-dominant）还是\n1025\t    CaCLR （capability-dominant）策略，在 78% 的 cases 中正确。\n1026\t\n1027\t    '\n1028\t  tables:\n1029\t  - name: 'Table 13: Decomposition Results'\n1030\t    columns:\n1031\t    - component\n1032\t    - var_pct\n1033\t    - transfer_auroc_mean\n1034\t    - transfer_drop_pp\n1035\t    - degradation_share_pct\n1036\t    rows:\n1037\t    - - full_correctness\n1038\t      - 100\n1039\t      - 0.71\n1040\t      - 9.0\n1041\t      - 100\n1042\t    - - difficulty_shared\n1043\t      - 65\n1044\t      - 0.698\n1045\t      - 1.1\n1046\t      - 12\n1047\t    - - capability_specific\n1048\t      - 35\n1049\t      - 0.615\n1050\t      - 12.8\n1051\t      - 88\n1052\t  - name: 'Table 14: Capability Transfer Drop by Depth'\n1053\t    columns:\n1054\t    - depth_band\n1055\t    - difficulty_drop_pp\n1056\t    - capability_drop_pp\n1057\t    - ratio\n1058\t    rows:\n1059\t    - - 20-30%\n1060\t      - 0.2\n1061\t      - 0.6\n1062\t      - 3×\n1063\t    - - 40-50%\n1064\t      - 0.6\n1065\t      - 2.8\n1066\t      - 4.7×\n1067\t    - - 60-70%\n1068\t      - 1.0\n1069\t      - 5.6\n1070\t      - 5.6×\n1071\t    - - 75-90%\n1072\t      - 1.5\n1073\t      - 8.5\n1074\t      - 5.7×\n1075\t  figures_description:\n1076\t  - 'Figure 7: Stacked area — difficulty (blue, flat) vs capability (red, exponentially\n1077\t    increasing) transfer degradation across depth.\n1078\t\n1079\t    '\n1080\t  analysis: 'Decomposition 清晰分离 transferable vs non-transferable components。 Difficulty\n1081\t    占大部分 variance 但 near-perfectly transfers（仅 12% degradation share），capability 占少数但驱动几乎所有\n1082\t    degradation。 这解释了为何 zero-shot transfer 在 mid-depth 工作（difficulty dominates there）但在\n1083\t    deep layers 失败（capability grows）。 Prescriptive accuracy 78% 证实 decomposition 不仅是描述性的，\n1084\t    而是可以指导 alignment strategy selection。\n1085\t\n1086\t    '\n1087\t- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity Analysis\n1088\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1089\t  description: 'Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 30, 50, 100, 200) for Procrustes alignment。\n1090\t    Both models × 5 representative layers × 20 languages。确定最小数据需求 和 resource-tier\n1091\t    分层饱和。\n1092\t\n1093\t    '\n1094\t  expected_results:\n1095\t    pairs_to_95pct_overall: 42\n1096\t    pairs_to_95pct_HIGH: 22\n1097\t    pairs_to_95pct_MID: 38\n1098\t    pairs_to_95pct_LOW: 48\n1099\t    pairs_10_pct_of_200: 0.72\n1100\t    pairs_20_pct_of_200: 0.86\n1101\t    pairs_30_pct_of_200: 0.92\n1102\t    pairs_50_pct_of_200: 0.97\n1103\t    pairs_100_pct_of_200: 0.99\n1104\t    pairs_200_baseline_auroc_mean: 0.729\n1105\t    procrustes_reversal_threshold: 0.52\n1106\t    procrustes_helps_below_threshold_delta_pp: 3.8\n1107\t    procrustes_hurts_above_threshold_delta_pp: -1.2\n1108\t  result_rationale: 'Linear projection (Procrustes) 学习 EN→target 的 rotation matrix。\n1109\t    20 pairs 即可估计 dominant rotational components（correctness subspace 是 low-dimensional\n1110\t    的，前几个 principal angles 解释 90%+ 的 alignment structure）。42 pairs 达到 95% 因为边际的 minor\n1111\t    components 需要更多 data 来稳定估计。\n1112\t\n1113\t    Resource-tier stratification 清晰：HIGH languages（zh/es/de 等）的 activation distributions\n1114\t    与 EN 更相似，rotation matrix 的 effective rank 更低（fewer parameters to estimate），22\n1115\t    pairs 即可。LOW languages 需要估计更 complex rotation（effective rank 更高），48 pairs。\n1116\t\n1117\t    Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52）：当 ZS AUROC < 0.52 时， correctness direction\n1118\t    严重 misaligned，Procrustes 纠正旋转带来 +3.8pp。 当 ZS AUROC > 0.60 时，directions 已经 well-aligned，Procrustes\n1119\t    引入 estimation noise 反而 hurt -1.2pp。Threshold 0.52 对应 CKA ~0.35 （与 plan_011 的 cliff\n1120\t    threshold 一致）。\n1121\t\n1122\t    这一 finding 直接 actionable：practitioners 应先测 ZS transfer， only apply Procrustes\n1123\t    when baseline < 0.52。\n1124\t\n1125\t    '\n1126\t  tables:\n1127\t  - name: 'Table 15: Projection Sample Efficiency'\n1128\t    columns:\n1129\t    - n_pairs\n1130\t    - pct_of_200pair_performance\n1131\t    - mean_auroc\n1132\t    - note\n1133\t    rows:\n1134\t    - - 10\n1135\t      - 72\n1136\t      - 0.724\n1137\t      - unstable, high variance across runs\n1138\t    - - 20\n1139\t      - 86\n1140\t      - 0.728\n1141\t      - captures dominant rotation\n1142\t    - - 30\n1143\t      - 92\n1144\t      - 0.731\n1145\t      - near plateau for HIGH langs\n1146\t    - - 50\n1147\t      - 97\n1148\t      - 0.734\n1149\t      - near plateau for all tiers\n1150\t    - - 100\n1151\t      - 99\n1152\t      - 0.737\n1153\t      - marginal returns\n1154\t    - - 200\n1155\t      - 100\n1156\t      - 0.729\n1157\t      - baseline (reference)\n1158\t  - name: 'Table 16: Saturation by Resource Tier'\n1159\t    columns:\n1160\t    - tier\n1161\t    - pairs_to_90pct\n1162\t    - pairs_to_95pct\n1163\t    - interpretation\n1164\t    rows:\n1165\t    - - HIGH\n1166\t      - 15\n1167\t      - 22\n1168\t      - rotation is simple, low effective rank\n1169\t    - - MID\n1170\t      - 25\n1171\t      - 38\n1172\t      - moderate rotation complexity\n1173\t    - - LOW\n1174\t      - 35\n1175\t      - 48\n1176\t      - complex rotation, more data needed\n1177\t  - name: 'Table 17: Procrustes Effect Reversal'\n1178\t    columns:\n1179\t    - zs_auroc_range\n1180\t    - n_lang_layer_pairs\n1181\t    - mean_delta_pp\n1182\t    - direction\n1183\t    rows:\n1184\t    - - <0.45\n1185\t      - 42\n1186\t      - 5.2\n1187\t      - strong positive\n1188\t    - - 0.45-0.52\n1189\t      - 68\n1190\t      - 2.4\n1191\t      - moderate positive\n1192\t    - - 0.52-0.60\n1193\t      - 95\n1194\t      - 0.3\n1195\t      - near-zero (transition zone)\n1196\t    - - 0.60-0.70\n1197\t      - 88\n1198\t      - -1.2\n1199\t      - negative — hurts\n1200\t    - - '>0.70'\n1201\t      - 47\n1202\t      - -0.8\n1203\t      - slight negative\n1204\t  figures_description:\n1205\t  - 'Figure 8a: Sample efficiency curves — AUROC (y) vs n_pairs (x), three curves\n1206\t    for HIGH/MID/LOW tiers, showing staggered saturation.\n1207\t\n1208\t    '\n1209\t  - 'Figure 8b: Procrustes effect reversal — delta AUROC (y) vs ZS baseline AUROC\n1210\t    (x), showing sign change at ~0.52. Dot size proportional to sample count.\n1211\t\n1212\t    '\n1213\t  analysis: '~42 pairs to 95% performance 是 directly actionable 的 practical finding：对于大多数语言，仅需\n1214\t    <50 parallel sentences 即可达到接近 supervised-level alignment。Resource-tier stratification（HIGH\n1215\t    22 vs LOW 48 pairs）提供了 per-language guidance。\n1216\t\n1217\t    Procrustes reversal at 0.52 与 CKA threshold 0.35 形成对应： CKA < 0.35 的 language-layer\n1218\t    combinations 对应 ZS < 0.52（ 因为 poor alignment → poor transfer），正好是 Procrustes 帮助最大的\n1219\t    区域。这构成了 geometric explanation 的 practical corollary。\n1220\t\n1221\t    '\n1222\t- name: Probing Control Tasks — Full-Scale Hewitt & Liang (2019)\n1223\t  plan_id: plan_013\n1224\t  description: 'Extend MVP English-only control task analysis to 20 languages × 2\n1225\t    architectures。Train probes on randomly permuted labels, compute selectivity =\n1226\t    real_AUROC - control_AUROC。Identify capacity artifacts by language, layer, and\n1227\t    model。\n1228\t\n1229\t    '\n1230\t  expected_results:\n1231\t    en_selectivity_range:\n1232\t    - 0.02\n1233\t    - 0.26\n1234\t    en_selectivity_meaningful_layers:\n1235\t    - 16\n1236\t    - 20\n1237\t    - 24\n1238\t    - 27\n1239\t    control_artifact_rate_lowres: 0.27\n1240\t    control_artifact_rate_midres: 0.05\n1241\t    control_artifact_rate_highres: 0.03\n1242\t    low_res_langs_most_affected:\n1243\t    - yo\n1244\t    - ig\n1245\t    - te\n1246\t    - sw\n1247\t    artifact_concentration_depth: 60-100% depth\n1248\t    cross_lingual_selectivity_mean:\n1249\t      HIGH: 0.22\n1250\t      MID: 0.18\n1251\t      LOW: 0.09\n1252\t    languages_with_any_meaningful_selectivity: 17\n1253\t    control_auroc_mean_all: 0.495\n1254\t    control_auroc_std: 0.008\n1255\t  result_rationale: 'MVP English data（selectivity L27=0.262）确立了 baseline。Cross-lingual\n1256\t    extension 揭示了 resource-tier dependent artifact pattern：\n1257\t\n1258\t    LOW-resource languages 的 27% artifact rate 源于两个因素：(1) these languages 在 model\n1259\t    pretraining 中占比极低，activation distributions 相对 high-resource 更 \"shallow\" (less\n1260\t    structured)，linear probes 更容易 通过 capacity 而非 genuine signal 拟合少量 patterns；(2)\n1261\t    GlobalMMLU 的 low-resource translations 质量较低，引入 noise 使 correctness signal 更弱，selectivity\n1262\t    更接近 chance。\n1263\t\n1264\t    Mid/high-resource 的 artifact rate 极低（3-5%）因为 representation quality 高，probe 有\n1265\t    genuine signal 可以 leverage。\n1266\t\n1267\t    Artifacts 集中在 60-100% depth，与 CKA cliff 一致：deep layers 的 low-resource CKA 已经很低（<0.2），cross-lingual\n1268\t    activation structure 不足以支撑 genuine correctness probing，probe 退化为 memorizing dataset-specific\n1269\t    patterns。\n1270\t\n1271\t    这一 finding 是 field-level contribution：此前没有人在 cross-lingual probing 中检查 selectivity\n1272\t    controls。28% 的 low-resource artifact rate 意味着没有 control tasks 的 cross-lingual\n1273\t    probing 结果 （包括 Xiao et al.）需要谨慎解读。\n1274\t\n1275\t    '\n1276\t  tables:\n1277\t  - name: 'Table 18: Selectivity by Resource Tier and Depth'\n1278\t    columns:\n1279\t    - depth_band\n1280\t    - HIGH_selectivity\n1281\t    - MID_selectivity\n1282\t    - LOW_selectivity\n1283\t    rows:\n1284\t    - - 0-30%\n1285\t      - 0.04\n1286\t      - 0.03\n1287\t      - 0.01\n1288\t    - - 30-60%\n1289\t      - 0.18\n1290\t      - 0.14\n1291\t      - 0.06\n1292\t    - - 60-80%\n1293\t      - 0.28\n1294\t      - 0.22\n1295\t      - 0.1\n1296\t    - - 80-100%\n1297\t      - 0.25\n1298\t      - 0.2\n1299\t      - 0.08\n1300\t  - name: 'Table 19: Artifact Rates by Tier'\n1301\t    columns:\n1302\t    - tier\n1303\t    - n_lang_layer_combinations\n1304\t    - artifact_count\n1305\t    - artifact_rate\n1306\t    rows:\n1307\t    - - HIGH\n1308\t      - 384\n1309\t      - 12\n1310\t      - 3%\n1311\t    - - MID\n1312\t      - 336\n1313\t      - 17\n1314\t      - 5%\n1315\t    - - LOW\n1316\t      - 240\n1317\t      - 65\n1318\t      - 27%\n1319\t    - - total\n1320\t      - 960\n1321\t      - 94\n1322\t      - 10%\n1323\t  figures_description:\n1324\t  - 'Figure S1: Selectivity heatmap — language (y, ordered by tier) × depth (x). LOW-resource\n1325\t    rows show gray (low selectivity) at deep layers.\n1326\t\n1327\t    '\n1328\t  analysis: '27% low-resource artifact rate 是 methodological warning for the field：\n1329\t    cross-lingual probing studies 如果不做 selectivity checks 会高估 low-resource transfer\n1330\t    quality。重要的是 artifacts 集中在 low-resource + deep layers，不波及 mid/high-resource 或\n1331\t    shallow layers，因此本文的 核心 Pareto/CKA 分析（主要基于 mid/high-resource patterns）不受影响。\n1332\t\n1333\t    '\n1334\t- name: Cross-Lingual Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality\n1335\t  plan_id: plan_005\n1336\t  description: 'Extract verbalized confidence direction, compute cosine similarity\n1337\t    with correctness direction, 20 languages × 2 architectures。 Supporting evidence\n1338\t    for Claim 4 (subsection)。\n1339\t\n1340\t    '\n1341\t  expected_results:\n1342\t    cosine_mean_overall: 0.05\n1343\t    cosine_range:\n1344\t    - 0.02\n1345\t    - 0.09\n1346\t    cosine_en: 0.03\n1347\t    all_below_0p10: true\n1348\t    qwen3_cosine_mean: 0.046\n1349\t    llama4_cosine_mean: 0.054\n1350\t    HIGH_cosine_mean: 0.038\n1351\t    MID_cosine_mean: 0.052\n1352\t    LOW_cosine_mean: 0.072\n1353\t    resource_tier_correlation: -0.66\n1354\t  result_rationale: 'Miao & Ungar (2026) 在 English 7-8B 上测得 cosine < 0.04。Extension\n1355\t    to 20 languages × 大模型应保持 near-orthogonality（< 0.10），因为这反映 transformer 的 structural\n1356\t    property：verbalized confidence 由 language modeling head 从 surface-level token\n1357\t    probabilities 生成，correctness 由 intermediate representations geometry 编码，两者 architecturally\n1358\t    decoupled。Low-resource 略高（0.072 mean）因为 confidence elicitation in low-resource\n1359\t    languages 更 noisy，不完全 decoupled。Resource-tier gradient（r=-0.66）说明更好的 multilingual\n1360\t    training → 更清晰的 correctness/confidence separation。\n1361\t\n1362\t    '\n1363\t  tables:\n1364\t  - name: 'Table 20: Orthogonality by Tier (cosine similarity)'\n1365\t    columns:\n1366\t    - tier\n1367\t    - n_langs\n1368\t    - qwen3_mean\n1369\t    - llama4_mean\n1370\t    - combined_mean\n1371\t    rows:\n1372\t    - - HIGH\n1373\t      - 8\n1374\t      - 0.035\n1375\t      - 0.041\n1376\t      - 0.038\n1377\t    - - MID\n1378\t      - 7\n1379\t      - 0.048\n1380\t      - 0.056\n1381\t      - 0.052\n1382\t    - - LOW\n1383\t      - 5\n1384\t      - 0.066\n1385\t      - 0.078\n1386\t      - 0.072\n1387\t  figures_description:\n1388\t  - 'Figure S2: Cosine similarity violin plots by resource tier, all below 0.10 threshold\n1389\t    line.\n1390\t\n1391\t    '\n1392\t  analysis: 'Orthogonality universally holds (39/40 pairs below 0.10, all 40 below\n1393\t    0.095)，confirming output-based calibration methods are structurally limited across\n1394\t    languages。Resource-tier gradient 是新 finding，但 effect size 小（range only 0.034），作为\n1395\t    subsection 足够。\n1396\t\n1397\t    '\n1398\t- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n1399\t  plan_id: plan_006\n1400\t  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP at each probed layer, both models。\n1401\t    Validates linear probe choice for transfer。\n1402\t\n1403\t    '\n1404\t  expected_results:\n1405\t    logreg_en_auroc_best: 0.81\n1406\t    mlp_en_auroc_best: 0.83\n1407\t    mlp_en_gain_pp: 2.0\n1408\t    logreg_zs_drop_mean_pp: 9.0\n1409\t    mlp_zs_drop_mean_pp: 14.5\n1410\t    logreg_transfer_advantage_pp: 5.5\n1411\t    logreg_advantage_shallow_pp: 2.0\n1412\t    logreg_advantage_deep_pp: 8.2\n1413\t  result_rationale: 'Linear probes learn 一个 hyperplane，跨语言泛化因为 correctness subspace\n1414\t    是 near-universal linear structure（subspace angle ~12° from plan_011）。 MLPs fit\n1415\t    nonlinear decision boundaries that overfit EN-specific feature interactions，gaining\n1416\t    +2pp EN AUROC but losing 5.5pp transfer。Gap 在 deep layers 放大（+8.2pp advantage\n1417\t    for logreg at 80% depth）因为 deep layers 有更多 language-specific nonlinear structure\n1418\t    for MLP to exploit。 This justifies logreg as primary probe and supports geometric\n1419\t    interpretation of Pareto frontier。\n1420\t\n1421\t    '\n1422\t  tables:\n1423\t  - name: 'Table S2: Probe Complexity (Qwen3, at EN-optimal layer)'\n1424\t    columns:\n1425\t    - probe_type\n1426\t    - en_auroc\n1427\t    - zs_mean_20\n1428\t    - zs_drop_pp\n1429\t    rows:\n1430\t    - - logistic_regression\n1431\t      - 0.81\n1432\t      - 0.72\n1433\t      - 9.0\n1434\t    - - mlp_2layer_h128\n1435\t      - 0.83\n1436\t      - 0.685\n1437\t      - 14.5\n1438\t  figures_description:\n1439\t  - 'Figure S3: Transfer drop (pp) vs depth, logreg (blue) vs MLP (red). MLP diverges\n1440\t    sharply past 60% depth.\n1441\t\n1442\t    '\n1443\t  analysis: 'Linear probes 为 cross-lingual transfer 的 optimal choice：牺牲 2pp EN performance\n1444\t    换取 5.5pp transfer improvement。Depth interaction confirms nonlinear language-specific\n1445\t    features drive deep-layer degradation。\n1446\t\n1447\t    '\n1448\t- name: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n1449\t  plan_id: plan_007\n1450\t  description: 'Evaluate best probes + CaCLR on Belebele and MMLU-ProX (20 languages\n1451\t    each)。Tests domain generalization。\n1452\t\n1453\t    '\n1454\t  expected_results:\n1455\t    belebele_zs_mean_20: 0.695\n1456\t    belebele_caclr_mean_20: 0.728\n1457\t    belebele_caclr_delta_pp: 3.3\n1458\t    mmlupx_zs_mean_20: 0.68\n1459\t    mmlupx_caclr_mean_20: 0.715\n1460\t    mmlupx_caclr_delta_pp: 3.5\n1461\t    cross_benchmark_caclr_cv: 0.04\n1462\t  result_rationale: 'Belebele (reading comprehension) 和 MMLU-ProX (harder factual)\n1463\t    的 baseline 略低于 GlobalMMLU 因为 domain shift，但 CaCLR 的 improvement 幅度 consistent（3.3-3.5pp\n1464\t    vs GlobalMMLU 的 3.5pp）。Low CV (0.04) 证实 CaCLR addresses 一个 fundamental representation\n1465\t    alignment issue 而非 overfitting to specific benchmark。\n1466\t\n1467\t    '\n1468\t  tables:\n1469\t  - name: 'Table 21: Cross-Benchmark CaCLR Generalization'\n1470\t    columns:\n1471\t    - benchmark\n1472\t    - zs_mean_20\n1473\t    - caclr_mean_20\n1474\t    - delta_pp\n1475\t    rows:\n1476\t    - - GlobalMMLU\n1477\t      - 0.71\n1478\t      - 0.745\n1479\t      - 3.5\n1480\t    - - Belebele\n1481\t      - 0.695\n1482\t      - 0.728\n1483\t      - 3.3\n1484\t    - - MMLU-ProX\n1485\t      - 0.68\n1486\t      - 0.715\n1487\t      - 3.5\n1488\t  figures_description:\n1489\t  - 'Figure S4: CaCLR improvement by benchmark × language, showing consistent gains.\n1490\t\n1491\t    '\n1492\t  analysis: 'CaCLR generalizes across benchmarks with low variance。Cross-benchmark\n1493\t    consistency is the strongest defense against overfitting concerns。\n1494\t\n1495\t    '\n1496\t- name: Quantization Validation Ablation\n1497\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1498\t  description: '(a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset; (b) GPTQ-Int4\n1499\t    vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset。\n1500\t\n1501\t    '\n1502\t  expected_results:\n1503\t    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.3\n1504\t    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 0.8\n1505\t    llama4_rank_correlation: 0.996\n1506\t    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.5\n1507\t    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 1.1\n1508\t    qwen3_rank_correlation: 0.994\n1509\t    conclusion: quantization introduces negligible distortion for probing\n1510\t  result_rationale: 'W4A16 (Llama4) 保留 16-bit activations，仅 weight 量化，对 activation\n1511\t    geometry 影响极小（0.3pp mean diff）。GPTQ-Int4 (Qwen3) 更 aggressive 但 correctness direction\n1512\t    的 angular structure 仍 robust（0.5pp mean diff）， 因为 quantization noise 近似 isotropic，不\n1513\t    preferentially distort correctness-relevant directions。Rank correlation > 0.994\n1514\t    确认 Pareto frontier ordering 完全保留。Qwen3 的 slightly higher diff (0.5 vs 0.3) 因为\n1515\t    Int4 比 W4A16 更 lossy。\n1516\t\n1517\t    '\n1518\t  tables:\n1519\t  - name: 'Table S3: Quantization Comparison (5 representative layers)'\n1520\t    columns:\n1521\t    - model\n1522\t    - layer\n1523\t    - fp16_auroc\n1524\t    - quant_auroc\n1525\t    - diff_pp\n1526\t    rows:\n1527\t    - - Llama4\n1528\t      - 8\n1529\t      - 0.637\n1530\t      - 0.634\n1531\t      - 0.3\n1532\t    - - Llama4\n1533\t      - 16\n1534\t      - 0.737\n1535\t      - 0.735\n1536\t      - 0.2\n1537\t    - - Llama4\n1538\t      - 28\n1539\t      - 0.784\n1540\t      - 0.781\n1541\t      - 0.3\n1542\t    - - Llama4\n1543\t      - 36\n1544\t      - 0.792\n1545\t      - 0.789\n1546\t      - 0.3\n1547\t    - - Llama4\n1548\t      - 44\n1549\t      - 0.774\n1550\t      - 0.77\n1551\t      - 0.4\n1552\t    - - Qwen3\n1553\t      - 20\n1554\t      - 0.712\n1555\t      - 0.708\n1556\t      - 0.4\n1557\t    - - Qwen3\n1558\t      - 36\n1559\t      - 0.78\n1560\t      - 0.775\n1561\t      - 0.5\n1562\t    - - Qwen3\n1563\t      - 52\n1564\t      - 0.808\n1565\t      - 0.803\n1566\t      - 0.5\n1567\t    - - Qwen3\n1568\t      - 68\n1569\t      - 0.812\n1570\t      - 0.806\n1571\t      - 0.6\n1572\t    - - Qwen3\n1573\t      - 80\n1574\t      - 0.807\n1575\t      - 0.8\n1576\t      - 0.7\n1577\t  figures_description:\n1578\t  - 'Figure S5: Quant vs FP16 scatter, y=x diagonal, tight clustering.\n1579\t\n1580\t    '\n1581\t  analysis: 'Quantization safe for both models。Preempts reviewer concern #5。\n1582\t\n1583\t    '\n1584\t- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture (Camera-Ready)\n1585\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1586\t  description: 'Full Pareto frontier on Gemma 4 31B Dense (60 layers, FP16), 20 languages。Provides\n1587\t    dense vs MoE contrast for camera-ready。\n1588\t\n1589\t    '\n1590\t  expected_results:\n1591\t    en_best_auroc: 0.8\n1592\t    en_best_layer_idx: 45\n1593\t    zs_mean_20lang: 0.71\n1594\t    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 36\n1595\t    global_spearman_rho: -0.85\n1596\t    per_lang_rho_median: -0.58\n1597\t    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.0\n1598\t    simpson_partial_rho: 0.44\n1599\t    simpson_partial_p: 0.004\n1600\t  result_rationale: 'Gemma 4 31B Dense 是理想的第三 data point：dense architecture（vs two\n1601\t    MoE models），different pretraining recipe（Google vs Alibaba/Meta）， 60 layers（between\n1602\t    Qwen 94 and Llama 48）。EN AUROC 0.80 低于 MoE models 因为 31B dense < 22B MoE active\n1603\t    (MoE routing 提供 effective capacity boost)。Pareto strength (ρ=-0.85) 介于 Qwen (-0.91)\n1604\t    和 Llama (-0.78) 之间。Simpson''s partial correlation 仍然显著 (rho=+0.44, p=0.004)， 确认\n1605\t    geometric insight 是 architecture-universal 而非 MoE-specific。\n1606\t\n1607\t    '\n1608\t  tables:\n1609\t  - name: 'Table 22: Three-Architecture Summary'\n1610\t    columns:\n1611\t    - model\n1612\t    - type\n1613\t    - layers\n1614\t    - en_best\n1615\t    - zs_mean_20\n1616\t    - pareto_rho\n1617\t    - simpson_partial_rho\n1618\t    - caclr_delta_pp\n1619\t    rows:\n1620\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n1621\t      - MoE\n1622\t      - 94\n1623\t      - 0.81\n1624\t      - 0.72\n1625\t      - -0.91\n1626\t      - 0.48\n1627\t      - 3.7\n1628\t    - - Llama4 Scout\n1629\t      - MoE\n1630\t      - 48\n1631\t      - 0.79\n1632\t      - 0.7\n1633\t      - -0.78\n1634\t      - 0.41\n1635\t      - 3.3\n1636\t    - - Gemma4 31B\n1637\t      - Dense\n1638\t      - 60\n1639\t      - 0.8\n1640\t      - 0.71\n1641\t      - -0.85\n1642\t      - 0.44\n1643\t      - 3.0\n1644\t  figures_description:\n1645\t  - 'Figure 9: Three-architecture Pareto frontiers overlaid (normalized depth %).\n1646\t    Remarkably similar shapes.\n1647\t\n1648\t    '\n1649\t  analysis: 'Three-architecture replication 是 universality claim 最强证据： Simpson''s\n1650\t    Paradox 在 dense 和 MoE 上都成立，Pareto frontier 在 55-60% depth 处一致出现 knee，CaCLR 提供\n1651\t    3-3.7pp consistent gain。 Dense vs MoE 的差异 minimal — phenomenon 是 transformer depth\n1652\t    的 property 而非 routing architecture 的。\n1653\t\n1654\t    '\n1655\t- name: Extended Language Coverage (Camera-Ready)\n1656\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1657\t  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages for camera-ready。\n1658\t\n1659\t    '\n1660\t  expected_results:\n1661\t    total_languages: 50\n1662\t    zs_pass_rate_50lang: 0.84\n1663\t    zs_auroc_above_060_count: 42\n1664\t    caclr_improvement_positive_count: 47\n1665\t    mean_zs_auroc_50lang: 0.69\n1666\t    mean_caclr_auroc_50lang: 0.72\n1667\t    pareto_frontier_holds_all_langs: true\n1668\t    new_families:\n1669\t    - Austronesian\n1670\t    - Dravidian\n1671\t    - Uralic\n1672\t    - Kartvelian\n1673\t    - Niger-Congo_B\n1674\t  result_rationale: 'Expansion 主要增加 mid-resource 语言（Indonesian, Finnish, Georgian,\n1675\t    Tamil, Telugu, etc.），大多 fall in 0.65-0.75 AUROC range。Extremely low-resource 语言（Amharic,\n1676\t    Khmer, Lao）可能 < 0.55 但代表 edge cases。 CaCLR 在 94% 的新增语言上 positive 因为 consistency\n1677\t    loss mechanism 是 language-agnostic。Pareto frontier structure 在 50 languages 上\n1678\t    完全保持。\n1679\t\n1680\t    '\n1681\t  tables:\n1682\t  - name: 'Table 23: Extended Coverage by Tier'\n1683\t    columns:\n1684\t    - tier\n1685\t    - n_langs\n1686\t    - zs_mean\n1687\t    - caclr_mean\n1688\t    - caclr_gain_pp\n1689\t    rows:\n1690\t    - - HIGH\n1691\t      - 10\n1692\t      - 0.75\n1693\t      - 0.78\n1694\t      - 2.8\n1695\t    - - MID\n1696\t      - 24\n1697\t      - 0.71\n1698\t      - 0.74\n1699\t      - 3.5\n1700\t    - - LOW\n1701\t      - 12\n1702\t      - 0.62\n1703\t      - 0.66\n1704\t      - 4.2\n1705\t    - - VERY_LOW\n1706\t      - 4\n1707\t      - 0.53\n1708\t      - 0.58\n1709\t      - 5.0\n1710\t  figures_description:\n1711\t  - 'Figure 10: World map with per-language CaCLR AUROC, colored by performance tier.\n1712\t    Broad geographic/typological coverage.\n1713\t\n1714\t    '\n1715\t  analysis: 50-language extension 确认 all findings at scale。Resource-tier gradient\n1716\t    smooth, CaCLR benefit inversely correlated with resource level, no language family\n1717\t    shows anomalous behavior。\n1718\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2f100d3-931f-4e74-a45a-f78f1352b916","uuid":"9de8257f-bc2e-4736-b775-8cf83f466406","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:49:31.785Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044911/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。以 Simpson''s Paradox 几何洞见为核心新颖性开篇—— raw CKA-transfer\n  correlation 为负（depth confound），partial correlation controlling for depth 在双架构上均显著为正（p\n  < 0.01），揭示 within-layer CKA genuinely predicts transfer quality。CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献（+3.5pp\n  mean over ZS），不是 headline 但 构成因果链第三环。标题强调 ''geometric analysis reveals when and\n  why cross-lingual calibration transfer succeeds''。四条 claim 完整因果链保留：Pareto discovery（architecture-\n  dependent depth-transferability tradeoff）→ Decomposition analysis（difficulty vs\n  capability separation）→ CaCLR method（consistency loss provides measurable gain at\n  deep layers）→ CKA geometric explanation（Simpson''s Paradox, subspace persistence）。\n  Control task warning（28% low-resource artifacts）和 linear projection sample efficiency\n  （~42 pairs to 95%）作为加分实证贡献。Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52） 为 practitioner\n  提供直接指导。无需弱化任何 claims。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '94-layer MoE (INT4, ~22B active), 24 probed layers (every 4th), 20\n    typologically diverse languages, English logistic regression probes, 5 transfer\n    conditions: zero-shot, mean-shift, linear projection (200 pairs), few-shot 25/100,\n    CaCLR。重点验证 MVP 发现的 strong depth-transferability tradeoff 是否在大模型上保持。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.81\n    en_best_layer_idx: 72\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.58\n    - 0.81\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.168\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.72\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 52\n    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.9\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.76\n      MID_mean: 0.72\n      LOW_mean: 0.63\n    zs_auroc_selected:\n      zh: 0.77\n      es: 0.76\n      fr: 0.76\n      de: 0.77\n      ja: 0.75\n      nl: 0.76\n      pt: 0.75\n      it: 0.75\n      ar: 0.73\n      hi: 0.71\n      ko: 0.72\n      tr: 0.71\n      ru: 0.74\n      vi: 0.7\n      th: 0.69\n      sw: 0.63\n      bn: 0.65\n      yo: 0.57\n      ig: 0.61\n      te: 0.58\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.64\n    per_lang_significant_at_005: 15\n    global_spearman_rho: -0.91\n    global_spearman_p: 0.0001\n    pareto_frontier_layers:\n    - 40\n    - 44\n    - 48\n    - 52\n    - 56\n    pareto_en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp: 4.2\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.74\n    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.708\n    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.735\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3-235B 的 22B active params 比 MVP Qwen2.5-7B 多 3×，log-linear\n    probing scaling 预期 EN AUROC 从 0.754 提升至 ~0.81。94 层深网络使 depth-transferability tradeoff\n    比 28 层 MVP 更显著：EN-optimal layer (L72, 77% depth) 与 ZS-optimal layer (L52, 55%\n    depth) 之间有 20 层间隔（MVP 仅 3 层）。Strong Pareto 源于 Qwen 架构特征：MoE routing 在深层产生 language-specific\n    expert 激活模式， 导致 correctness direction 的 cross-lingual alignment 在 L60 后急剧下降。 15/20\n    languages 的 per-language Spearman rho 显著为负，表明 tradeoff 是 跨语言一致的。2 个 fail 语言（yo,\n    te）的 AUROC < 0.60 因为 Qwen3 pretraining corpus 中 Yoruba/Telugu 占比极低（<0.1%），embedding\n    层的 representation quality 即不足以支撑 correctness signal。Mean-shift ΔAUROC ≡ 0 因为 StandardScaler\n    + LR 下 mean-shift 对 AUROC 无影响（已在 MVP 中数学证明）。 Linear projection (200 pairs) 提供\n    +2pp 因为 Procrustes alignment 捕获了 correctness subspace 的旋转，但不触及 distributional\n    matching。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Qwen3-235B Pareto Frontier (selected layers)'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_pp\n    - on_pareto\n    rows:\n    - - 4\n      - 4\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.572\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n    - - 12\n      - 13\n      - 0.645\n      - 0.632\n      - 1.3\n      - false\n    - - 20\n      - 21\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.695\n      - 1.5\n      - false\n    - - 28\n      - 30\n      - 0.752\n      - 0.733\n      - 1.9\n      - false\n    - - 36\n      - 38\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.752\n      - 2.6\n      - false\n    - - 40\n      - 43\n      - 0.788\n      - 0.748\n      - 4.0\n      - true\n    - - 44\n      - 47\n      - 0.796\n      - 0.74\n      - 5.6\n      - true\n    - - 48\n      - 51\n      - 0.802\n      - 0.732\n      - 7.0\n      - true\n    - - 52\n      - 55\n      - 0.806\n      - 0.72\n      - 8.6\n      - true\n    - - 56\n      - 60\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.706\n      - 10.2\n      - true\n    - - 60\n      - 64\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.69\n      - 12.0\n      - false\n    - - 68\n      - 72\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.661\n      - 14.9\n      - false\n    - - 72\n      - 77\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.638\n      - 17.2\n      - false\n    - - 80\n      - 85\n      - 0.805\n      - 0.601\n      - 20.4\n      - false\n    - - 88\n      - 94\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.558\n      - 23.4\n      - false\n    - - 92\n      - 98\n      - 0.778\n      - 0.531\n      - 24.7\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Language Spearman ρ (depth vs ZS AUROC), Qwen3'\n    columns:\n    - language\n    - tier\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - zh\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.72\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - es\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.68\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - fr\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.7\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - de\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.69\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - ja\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.74\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - nl\n      - HIGH\n      - -0.67\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - pt\n      - MID\n      - -0.65\n      - 0.004\n      - true\n    - - it\n      - MID\n      - -0.66\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - ar\n      - MID\n      - -0.71\n      - 0.001\n      - true\n    - - hi\n      - MID\n      - -0.63\n      - 0.005\n      - true\n    - - ko\n      - MID\n      - -0.67\n      - 0.003\n      - true\n    - - tr\n      - MID\n      - -0.62\n      - 0.006\n      - true\n    - - ru\n      - MID\n      - -0.69\n      - 0.002\n      - true\n    - - vi\n      - MID\n      - -0.61\n      - 0.008\n      - true\n    - - th\n      - MID\n      - -0.58\n      - 0.012\n      - true\n    - - sw\n      - LOW\n      - -0.52\n      - 0.025\n      - true\n    - - bn\n      - LOW\n      - -0.55\n      - 0.018\n      - false\n    - - yo\n      - LOW\n      - -0.48\n      - 0.042\n      - false\n    - - ig\n      - LOW\n      - -0.51\n      - 0.028\n      - false\n    - - te\n      - LOW\n      - -0.45\n      - 0.058\n      - false\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1a: Pareto frontier scatter (EN AUROC x-axis vs ZS mean AUROC y-axis),\n    24 points, 5 Pareto-optimal layers marked red. Clear convex knee at ~55% depth.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 1b: Heatmap — ZS AUROC by language (y-axis, ordered by resource tier)\n    × normalized depth (x-axis). Warm mid-band, low-resource rows cool earlier at\n    shallower depth than high-resource rows.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Qwen3-235B 展现 strong, consistent depth-transferability tradeoff： global\n    Spearman ρ = -0.91 (p < 0.001), 15/20 per-language ρ 显著为负。 Pareto frontier 包含\n    5 层 (L40-L56)，knee 在 ~55% depth。EN-optimal (L72) 与 ZS-optimal (L52) 相隔 20 层 /\n    22pp depth，远大于 MVP 的 3 层 间隔。这证实 tradeoff 在大模型上不是减弱而是放大——更深的网络有更多 空间进行 language-specific\n    specialization。High-resource 语言在 Pareto knee 以下也保持 AUROC > 0.74，但 low-resource\n    在 70% depth 后急剧下降。 这与 CKA 分析一致：CKA 在 L60 后的 cliff 解释了为何 deep-layer transfer 对\n    low-resource 影响更大（CKA 基线更低，cliff 更早触及）。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '48-layer MoE (W4A16, 17B×16E, top-2 routing), 12 probed layers (every\n    4th), 20 languages, 5 transfer conditions。验证 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak/mixed tradeoff\n    pattern 是否是 Llama 架构家族特征。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.79\n    en_best_layer_idx: 36\n    en_auroc_range:\n    - 0.56\n    - 0.79\n    en_ece_raw_best: 0.182\n    zs_mean_auroc_20lang_best_transfer_layer: 0.7\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 28\n    zs_pass_rate_20lang: 0.85\n    zs_fail_langs:\n    - yo\n    - te\n    - ig\n    zs_auroc_by_tier:\n      HIGH_mean: 0.74\n      MID_mean: 0.7\n      LOW_mean: 0.61\n    per_lang_spearman_rho_median: -0.28\n    per_lang_significant_at_005: 6\n    per_lang_positive_rho_langs:\n    - ar\n    - hi\n    - ko\n    global_spearman_rho: -0.78\n    global_spearman_p: 0.003\n    pareto_frontier_layers:\n    - 20\n    - 24\n    - 28\n    mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.0\n    linproj_200pairs_mean_auroc: 0.718\n    fewshot_25_mean_auroc: 0.692\n    fewshot_100_mean_auroc: 0.718\n  result_rationale: 'Llama 4 Scout 延续 MVP Llama-3.1-8B 的 weak tradeoff 模式。虽然 global\n    Spearman ρ = -0.78 仍然显著（12 data points, p=0.003），但 per-language 分析揭示了明显的异质性：仅\n    6/20 languages 有显著负 ρ，而 ar/hi/ko 展现正 ρ（深层 transfer 反而改善）。这与 MVP 完全一致（ar/ko 在 L31\n    优于 L20），且可归因于 Llama 架构的 multilingual training recipe：Meta 的训练策略使 ar/hi/ko 在深层保持更好的\n    cross-lingual alignment，可能 因为这些语言在 pretraining 中与 English 有更多 code-switching 数据。\n    Global rho 仍然显著是因为大多数语言确实有弱负趋势，但 per-language 分析揭示这不是 universal pattern。与 Qwen3\n    的对比清晰：Qwen3 的 15/20 significant vs Llama4 的 6/20，median rho -0.64 vs -0.28。这一\n    architecture-dependent tradeoff strength 是 Claim 1 的核心发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Llama 4 Scout Pareto Frontier'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_pp\n    - on_pareto\n    rows:\n    - - 4\n      - 8\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.552\n      - 0.8\n      - false\n    - - 8\n      - 17\n      - 0.635\n      - 0.625\n      - 1.0\n      - false\n    - - 12\n      - 25\n      - 0.695\n      - 0.682\n      - 1.3\n      - false\n    - - 16\n      - 33\n      - 0.735\n      - 0.718\n      - 1.7\n      - false\n    - - 20\n      - 42\n      - 0.758\n      - 0.724\n      - 3.4\n      - true\n    - - 24\n      - 50\n      - 0.772\n      - 0.714\n      - 5.8\n      - true\n    - - 28\n      - 58\n      - 0.782\n      - 0.7\n      - 8.2\n      - true\n    - - 32\n      - 67\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.681\n      - 10.8\n      - false\n    - - 36\n      - 75\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.655\n      - 13.5\n      - false\n    - - 40\n      - 83\n      - 0.785\n      - 0.625\n      - 16.0\n      - false\n    - - 44\n      - 92\n      - 0.772\n      - 0.589\n      - 18.3\n      - false\n    - - 48\n      - 100\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.548\n      - 20.0\n      - false\n  - name: 'Table 4: Architecture-Dependent Pareto Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - Qwen3_235B\n    - Llama4_Scout\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - global_rho\n      - -0.91\n      - -0.78\n      - both significant but Qwen stronger\n    - - per_lang_sig_count\n      - 15/20\n      - 6/20\n      - Qwen consistent, Llama mixed\n    - - median_per_lang_rho\n      - -0.64\n      - -0.28\n      - 2.3x difference in effect size\n    - - positive_rho_langs\n      - 0\n      - 3\n      - Llama has ar/hi/ko reversed\n    - - best_transfer_depth_pct\n      - 55\n      - 58\n      - comparable location\n    - - en_zs_gap_at_knee_pp\n      - 4.2\n      - 3.4\n      - comparable magnitude\n  - name: 'Table 5: Transfer Conditions Comparison (both models, at best-transfer\n      layer)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - Qwen3_mean_20\n    - Llama4_mean_20\n    - combined_mean\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.71\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.71\n    - - linear_proj_200\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.729\n    - - few-shot-25\n      - 0.708\n      - 0.692\n      - 0.7\n    - - few-shot-100\n      - 0.735\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.727\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Overlaid Pareto frontiers (normalized depth), Qwen3 in blue, Llama4\n    in orange. Qwen3 shifted up-right with steeper descent; Llama4 flatter with more\n    scatter at deep layers.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 3: Per-language Spearman ρ distribution: Qwen3 (left) tightly clustered\n    around -0.65; Llama4 (right) spread from -0.50 to +0.35, ar/hi/ko clearly positive.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Architecture-dependent Pareto strength 是 Claim 1 的核心。两个架构的 global rho\n    都显著（满足 pareto_spearman_rho_significant_archs = 2 的 约束），但 effect size 差异明显。Qwen3\n    的 strong tradeoff 意味着 practitioner 必须在 EN accuracy 和 transfer quality 之间做明确选择；\n    Llama4 的 weak tradeoff 意味着某些语言（ar, hi, ko）可以 \"free-ride\" 深层的 EN improvement 而不牺牲\n    transfer。这一差异无法从 domain adaptation theory 预测——它是架构特有的 empirical finding。 Best-transfer\n    depth 在两个架构上收敛至 55-58%，暗示一个 universal \"mid-depth transfer zone\"，但 frontier 的 steepness\n    是 architecture-specific。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'Linear CKA (EN vs each target) at every probed layer, 20 languages\n    × 2 models。核心分析：(a) same-layer cross-language correlation (n=20 per layer), (b)\n    partial Spearman controlling for normalized depth — THE single most important\n    analysis, (c) subspace angle quantitative analysis, (d) CKA cliff threshold identification。验证\n    pilot finding 的 Simpson''s Paradox 在 full-scale 上双架构复现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_raw_rho: -0.36\n    qwen3_raw_p: 0.0001\n    llama4_raw_rho: -0.41\n    llama4_raw_p: 0.0001\n    qwen3_partial_rho: 0.48\n    qwen3_partial_p: 0.002\n    qwen3_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.31\n    - 0.62\n    llama4_partial_rho: 0.41\n    llama4_partial_p: 0.008\n    llama4_partial_bootstrap_ci_95:\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.57\n    simpson_paradox_confirmed_both_archs: true\n    qwen3_per_layer_positive_count: 18\n    qwen3_per_layer_significant_count: 6\n    llama4_per_layer_positive_count: 9\n    llama4_per_layer_significant_count: 3\n    qwen3_cka_peak_layer: 16\n    qwen3_cka_peak_value: 0.82\n    qwen3_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.28\n    qwen3_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 55\n    llama4_cka_peak_layer: 12\n    llama4_cka_peak_value: 0.84\n    llama4_cka_at_en_optimal_layer: 0.35\n    llama4_cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 50\n    transfer_collapse_cka_threshold: 0.35\n    below_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.58\n    above_threshold_mean_zs_auroc: 0.72\n    correctness_subspace_angle_within_layer_mean_deg: 12.4\n    correctness_subspace_angle_across_layer_mean_deg: 38.7\n    correctness_direction_persists_despite_global_cka_decline: true\n  result_rationale: 'Simpson''s Paradox 的 causal mechanism：depth 同时作用于 CKA（deeper\n    → representations diverge → CKA drops）和 transfer AUROC（deeper → EN probe stronger\n    → higher absolute AUROC up to a point），创造了一个 confound。 Raw pooled correlation\n    为负是因为 shallow layers 有 high CKA 但 low AUROC （probe 本身弱），deep layers 有 low CKA\n    但 higher AUROC（probe 强虽然 transfer degrades）。控制 depth 后，within 每个 layer，higher\n    CKA 的 语言确实有 better transfer，partial rho 为正。\n\n    MVP pilot（Llama, 5 langs × 9 layers）已展现 rho=+0.41, p=0.006。 Full-scale（20 langs\n    × 12-24 layers）增强统计 power：per-layer test 从 n=5 增至 n=20，partial correlation 的 bootstrap\n    CI 不含零。\n\n    Qwen3 partial rho (0.48) 高于 Llama4 (0.41)，与 Qwen 的 steeper CKA cliff 一致：Qwen 的\n    CKA 变异范围更大（peak 0.82 → floor 0.28 vs Llama 0.84 → 0.35），为 partial correlation\n    提供更多 signal。\n\n    MVP Qwen pilot 仅 rho=+0.18 (p=0.274)，full-scale上升至 0.48 是因为： (1) n 从 5 增至 20 语言，power\n    大幅提升；(2) 20 语言覆盖更宽的 CKA 范围（增加了 yo/ig/te 等极低 CKA 语言和 nl/pt 等高 CKA 语言）， 扩大了 within-layer\n    variance。\n\n    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 标记了 \"transfer collapse zone\"：当 CKA 低于此阈值时，correctness\n    direction 的 cross-lingual overlap 不足以 支撑 zero-shot transfer。Subspace angle analysis\n    揭示 correctness direction 在同一 layer 内跨语言仅旋转 ~12°（highly aligned），但跨 layer 旋转 ~39°（significant\n    drift），解释了为何 within-layer CKA 预测 transfer 但 raw pooled 不预测。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Simpson''s Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - analysis\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    - bootstrap_95CI\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n      - -0.36\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.44, -0.27]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.002\n      - '[+0.31, +0.62]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - raw pooled (CKA vs ZS AUROC)\n      - -0.41\n      - <0.001\n      - '[-0.50, -0.31]'\n      - negative — depth confound\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - partial (controlling depth)\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.008\n      - '[+0.22, +0.57]'\n      - positive — genuine geometric signal\n  - name: 'Table 7: Per-Layer CKA-Transfer Correlation (Qwen3, selected layers)'\n    columns:\n    - layer_idx\n    - depth_pct\n    - mean_CKA_20lang\n    - spearman_rho_n20\n    - p_value\n    rows:\n    - - 12\n      - 13\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.019\n    - - 20\n      - 21\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.032\n    - - 28\n      - 30\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.012\n    - - 36\n      - 38\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.022\n    - - 44\n      - 47\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.46\n      - 0.041\n    - - 52\n      - 55\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.058\n    - - 60\n      - 64\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.098\n    - - 68\n      - 72\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.33\n      - 0.155\n    - - 72\n      - 77\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.231\n    - - 80\n      - 85\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.21\n      - 0.372\n  - name: 'Table 8: CKA Heatmap Summary (Qwen3, mean across 20 langs by tier)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - HIGH_CKA\n    - MID_CKA\n    - LOW_CKA\n    - overall_CKA\n    rows:\n    - - 13\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.78\n    - - 30\n      - 0.84\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.76\n    - - 47\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.56\n    - - 64\n      - 0.48\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.38\n    - - 77\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.28\n    - - 94\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.09\n      - 0.19\n  - name: 'Table 9: Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction)'\n    columns:\n    - comparison_type\n    - mean_angle_deg\n    - std_deg\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - within-layer cross-language (same layer, different langs)\n      - 12.4\n      - 5.8\n      - highly aligned — correctness direction is near-universal\n    - - cross-layer same-language (same lang, different layers)\n      - 38.7\n      - 11.2\n      - significant drift — direction rotates with depth\n    - - random baseline (shuffled)\n      - 87.3\n      - 2.1\n      - near-orthogonal — signal is non-trivial\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4a: Simpson''s Paradox visualization — left panel: raw scatter (CKA vs\n    ZS AUROC) showing negative trend with depth-colored points; right panel: partial\n    residual plot after controlling for depth showing positive trend. Two panels side\n    by side dramatically illustrate the sign reversal.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4b: CKA × layer × language heatmap for Qwen3 (main) and Llama4 (inset).\n    Color intensity = CKA value. Clear gradient from warm (shallow, high CKA) to cool\n    (deep, low CKA), with low-resource languages cooling faster.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 4c: CKA threshold scatter — transfer AUROC (y) vs CKA (x), vertical dashed\n    line at CKA=0.35 showing transfer collapse zone.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Simpson''s Paradox 在双架构上显著复现（partial rho Qwen=+0.48 p=0.002, Llama=+0.41\n    p=0.008），是本文的核心几何洞见。这不是 trivially expected from measurement overlap（CKA 和 transfer\n    AUROC 都衡量 EN-target 相似性） ——sign reversal 从负到正是 non-trivial 的。\n\n    Subspace angle analysis 提供 mechanistic grounding：correctness direction 在同一 layer\n    内跨语言仅 ~12° 偏差（near-universal），但跨 layer 偏差 ~39°（significant rotation）。这解释了为何 CKA（衡量全局\n    representation similarity）与 transfer（衡量 correctness direction alignment）的关系 需要控制\n    depth 后才能显现：全局 CKA 下降反映的是 non-correctness dimensions 的 divergence，correctness\n    subspace 本身作为 low-dimensional feature 持续存在。\n\n    CKA cliff threshold ~0.35 直接解释了 Qwen3 vs Llama4 tradeoff 差异： Qwen3 的 CKA cliff\n    更陡（L52→L60 从 0.45 降至 0.38），导致更多语言 在 deep layers 穿越 threshold → strong tradeoff；Llama4\n    的 cliff 更缓 （L28→L36 从 0.55 降至 0.45），且 ar/hi/ko 因高 baseline CKA 从不穿越 threshold\n    → weak/mixed tradeoff。\n\n    这一分析将 Claim 1 的 Pareto observation 与 CKA geometry 连接，构成 完整的 geometric explanation：architecture-dependent\n    CKA cliff steepness → architecture-dependent Pareto frontier strength。\n\n    '\n- name: CaCLR Implementation and Comparative Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 'L_CaCLR = L_BCE + α·L_SB-ECE + β·L_consistency (MMD on 1-D probe logits).\n    English labels + parallel activations from GlobalMMLU test-split 70/30 partition.\n    Compare vs zero-shot/mean-shift/linear-proj/few-shot across full Pareto frontier,\n    both models × 20 languages. α sweep [0.01–10], β sweep [0.001–1.0] across 3 OOM.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    best_alpha: 0.1\n    best_beta: 0.05\n    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs: 0.035\n    caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_linproj: 0.015\n    caclr_improvement_at_deep_layers_pp: 4.8\n    caclr_improvement_at_shallow_layers_pp: 1.2\n    caclr_improvement_pass_rate: 0.88\n    qwen3_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.757\n    qwen3_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.7\n    qwen3_caclr_ece_mean: 0.078\n    llama4_caclr_mean_auroc_20lang: 0.733\n    llama4_caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.3\n    llama4_caclr_ece_mean: 0.085\n    beta_0001_delta_pp: 0.5\n    beta_001_delta_pp: 1.8\n    beta_005_delta_pp: 3.5\n    beta_01_delta_pp: 3.2\n    beta_10_delta_pp: 0.8\n    alpha_001_ece_improvement_pp: 1.5\n    alpha_01_ece_improvement_pp: 3.2\n    alpha_10_ece_improvement_pp: 2.8\n    alpha_100_ece_improvement_pp: -0.5\n    bce_only_auroc: 0.71\n    bce_sbece_auroc: 0.722\n    bce_consistency_auroc: 0.738\n    bce_sbece_consistency_auroc: 0.745\n    mmd_kernel: Gaussian RBF, bandwidth=median heuristic\n    optimizer: Adam, lr=1e-3, linear warmup 10%\n    epochs: 50\n    early_stopping: patience=10, monitor=val_auroc\n    initialization: from standard LR solution\n    batch_size: 256\n    mmd_items: same items as BCE (overlapping)\n    parallel_set_size_range:\n    - 1800\n    - 4200\n  result_rationale: 'CaCLR 的 consistency loss (β·MMD on 1-D logits) 强制 probe 学习 language-invariant\n    features：EN 和 target-language 的 probe 输出分布 应相似。在 1-D logit space 中，MMD 有效地匹配了两种语言的\n    logit mean 和 variance，等价于让 probe direction 靠近 CKA analysis 中揭示的 \"universal correctness\n    subspace\"。\n\n    +3.5pp mean delta（[2, 5] range 内）反映了 1-D MMD 的能力边界：它能 捕获 first-order distributional\n    alignment（mean/variance matching）， 但无法完成 full rotational alignment（需要 d-dimensional\n    操作）。Linear projection（+2pp）通过 Procrustes 做了 rotational alignment 但不优化 probe 本身；CaCLR\n    的优势在于 end-to-end 优化但受 1-D 约束。两者差距 仅 1.5pp，说明 correctness transfer 的瓶颈主要是 rotational（线性\n    投影解决的）而非 distributional（MMD 解决的）。\n\n    β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现 \"sweet spot\"：β=0.001 太弱（gradient noise > signal），β=1.0\n    太强（MMD 主导 BCE，probe accuracy 下降 2pp）。 Optimal β=0.05 平衡了 accuracy 和 consistency。\n\n    Deep-layer improvement (+4.8pp) 远大于 shallow-layer (+1.2pp)，因为 deep layers 有更大的\n    capability-specific component（Claim 2 decomposition 所揭示），CaCLR 的 consistency loss\n    正好 target 这个 component。这与 difficulty-capability decomposition 形成因果闭环。\n\n    88% improvement pass rate（35/40 model-lang pairs）：5 个 non-improving pairs 是 HIGH-resource\n    languages（如 Qwen3-zh, Qwen3-nl）on shallow layers where ZS transfer 已经接近 ceiling。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: β Sweep — Consistency Loss Effect'\n    columns:\n    - beta\n    - mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs_pp\n    - mean_delta_ece_pp\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n      - baseline (BCE only)\n    - - 0.001\n      - 0.5\n      - -0.3\n      - marginal improvement\n    - - 0.01\n      - 1.8\n      - -1.1\n      - clear positive signal\n    - - 0.05\n      - 3.5\n      - -2.4\n      - optimal — best tradeoff\n    - - 0.1\n      - 3.2\n      - -2.0\n      - slight over-regularization\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.8\n      - -0.5\n      - MMD dominates, probe accuracy degrades\n  - name: 'Table 11: CaCLR vs All Methods (at best-transfer layer, both models averaged)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auroc_mean_20\n    - ece_mean_20\n    - requires_labels\n    - key_resource\n    rows:\n    - - zero-shot\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.118\n      - none\n      - —\n    - - mean-shift\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.118\n      - none\n      - —\n    - - linear_proj_50\n      - 0.725\n      - 0.098\n      - 50 parallel pairs\n      - Procrustes\n    - - linear_proj_200\n      - 0.729\n      - 0.095\n      - 200 parallel pairs\n      - Procrustes\n    - - few-shot-25\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.102\n      - 25 labeled\n      - target labels\n    - - few-shot-100\n      - 0.727\n      - 0.088\n      - 100 labeled\n      - target labels\n    - - CaCLR\n      - 0.745\n      - 0.082\n      - none\n      - parallel activations\n  - name: 'Table 12: CaCLR Depth Profile (Qwen3, ZS AUROC vs CaCLR AUROC)'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pct\n    - zs_auroc\n    - caclr_auroc\n    - delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - 30\n      - 0.733\n      - 0.745\n      - 1.2\n    - - 43\n      - 0.748\n      - 0.766\n      - 1.8\n    - - 55\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.752\n      - 3.2\n    - - 64\n      - 0.69\n      - 0.738\n      - 4.8\n    - - 77\n      - 0.638\n      - 0.688\n      - 5.0\n    - - 85\n      - 0.601\n      - 0.641\n      - 4.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5: β sweep curve — delta AUROC (y) vs log10(β) (x), inverted-U shape peaking\n    at β=0.05. Inset shows corresponding ECE improvement.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 6: CaCLR depth profile — ZS (blue) vs CaCLR (red) AUROC across normalized\n    depth. Gap widens at deep layers, demonstrating CaCLR specifically addresses deep-layer\n    transfer degradation.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'CaCLR 作为正面方法贡献：β>0 在 deep layers 上提供 ≥2pp AUROC improvement（实际 deep-layer\n    mean = +4.8pp），且 β sweep across 3 OOM 清晰展现最优区间。Component ablation 证实 L_consistency\n    是主要 contributor（+2.8pp），L_SB-ECE 提供 complementary calibration improvement（+0.7pp\n    ECE, +0.7pp AUROC synergy）。\n\n    CaCLR 超越 linear projection 1.5pp 是因为 end-to-end 优化可以利用 training dynamics（gradient\n    信号引导 probe 朝 language-invariant direction 收敛），而 Procrustes 只做 post-hoc geometric\n    correction。但差距不大 是因为 1-D MMD 的 expressiveness 有限——它只能匹配 scalar logit distributions，不能做\n    full subspace alignment。\n\n    Deep-layer improvement 模式与 Claim 2 的 decomposition 一致：deep layers 的 capability-specific\n    component 更大，CaCLR 的 consistency loss 正好 在这些 layers 有更多 signal 来 exploit。这构成 Pareto→Decomposition→CaCLR→CKA\n    因果链的第三环。\n\n    '\n- name: Difficulty-Controlled Ablation (Decomposition)\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'IRT difficulty probes (Ridge regression), project out difficulty direction,\n    retrain correctness probes on residuals, evaluate transfer。10 languages (HIGH:\n    zh/es/fr/de, MID: hi/ru/ko/tr, LOW: sw/bn) × 8 layers (20-90% depth) per model。包含\n    random-direction control。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    difficulty_probe_r2_mean: 0.68\n    difficulty_probe_r2_range:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.78\n    difficulty_var_explained_pct: 65\n    capability_var_explained_pct: 35\n    difficulty_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 12\n    capability_transfer_degradation_share_pct: 88\n    decomp_capability_delta_auroc: 0.03\n    residual_en_auroc_drop_pp: 4.5\n    residual_zs_transfer_drop_pp: 0.8\n    random_direction_control_delta_pp: -1.2\n    prescriptive_accuracy: 0.78\n    capability_transfer_drop_by_depth:\n      20pct: 0.6\n      50pct: 2.8\n      80pct: 8.5\n  result_rationale: 'IRT difficulty 是 language-agnostic property：hard questions are\n    hard everywhere。Ridge regression captures this linearly (R²=0.68, 与 Civelli et\n    al. 的 shared difficulty finding 一致)。Difficulty 占 correctness variance 的 65% 但仅贡献\n    12% 的 transfer degradation， 因为 difficulty signal 本质上是 universal 的。Capability-specific\n    residual 仅占 35% variance 但驱动 88% 的 transfer degradation，且 degradation 随 depth\n    指数增长（20% depth: 0.6pp → 80% depth: 8.5pp）。\n\n    这一 decomposition 解释了 Pareto frontier 的 mechanistic origin： deep layers 的 EN probe\n    improvement 主要来自 capability-specific component（language-dependent competence），而这个\n    component 恰好是 最难 transfer 的。CaCLR 的 consistency loss works precisely because it\n    targets this component。\n\n    Random-direction control（-1.2pp, 随机方向 projection 反而损害）确认 difficulty direction\n    不是 arbitrary dimensionality reduction 的 artifact， 而是 genuine signal。\n\n    Prescriptive accuracy 78%：给定语言-layer 的 difficulty/capability ratio，预测应使用 zero-shot（difficulty-dominant）还是\n    CaCLR （capability-dominant）策略，在 78% 的 cases 中正确。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Decomposition Results'\n    columns:\n    - component\n    - var_pct\n    - transfer_auroc_mean\n    - transfer_drop_pp\n    - degradation_share_pct\n    rows:\n    - - full_correctness\n      - 100\n      - 0.71\n      - 9.0\n      - 100\n    - - difficulty_shared\n      - 65\n      - 0.698\n      - 1.1\n      - 12\n    - - capability_specific\n      - 35\n      - 0.615\n      - 12.8\n      - 88\n  - name: 'Table 14: Capability Transfer Drop by Depth'\n    columns:\n    - depth_band\n    - difficulty_drop_pp\n    - capability_drop_pp\n    - ratio\n    rows:\n    - - 20-30%\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.6\n      - 3×\n    - - 40-50%\n      - 0.6\n      - 2.8\n      - 4.7×\n    - - 60-70%\n      - 1.0\n      - 5.6\n      - 5.6×\n    - - 75-90%\n      - 1.5\n      - 8.5\n      - 5.7×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 7: Stacked area — difficulty (blue, flat) vs capability (red, exponentially\n    increasing) transfer degradation across depth.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Decomposition 清晰分离 transferable vs non-transferable components。 Difficulty\n    占大部分 variance 但 near-perfectly transfers（仅 12% degradation share），capability 占少数但驱动几乎所有\n    degradation。 这解释了为何 zero-shot transfer 在 mid-depth 工作（difficulty dominates there）但在\n    deep layers 失败（capability grows）。 Prescriptive accuracy 78% 证实 decomposition 不仅是描述性的，\n    而是可以指导 alignment strategy selection。\n\n    '\n- name: Linear Projection Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 30, 50, 100, 200) for Procrustes alignment。\n    Both models × 5 representative layers × 20 languages。确定最小数据需求 和 resource-tier\n    分层饱和。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    pairs_to_95pct_overall: 42\n    pairs_to_95pct_HIGH: 22\n    pairs_to_95pct_MID: 38\n    pairs_to_95pct_LOW: 48\n    pairs_10_pct_of_200: 0.72\n    pairs_20_pct_of_200: 0.86\n    pairs_30_pct_of_200: 0.92\n    pairs_50_pct_of_200: 0.97\n    pairs_100_pct_of_200: 0.99\n    pairs_200_baseline_auroc_mean: 0.729\n    procrustes_reversal_threshold: 0.52\n    procrustes_helps_below_threshold_delta_pp: 3.8\n    procrustes_hurts_above_threshold_delta_pp: -1.2\n  result_rationale: 'Linear projection (Procrustes) 学习 EN→target 的 rotation matrix。\n    20 pairs 即可估计 dominant rotational components（correctness subspace 是 low-dimensional\n    的，前几个 principal angles 解释 90%+ 的 alignment structure）。42 pairs 达到 95% 因为边际的 minor\n    components 需要更多 data 来稳定估计。\n\n    Resource-tier stratification 清晰：HIGH languages（zh/es/de 等）的 activation distributions\n    与 EN 更相似，rotation matrix 的 effective rank 更低（fewer parameters to estimate），22\n    pairs 即可。LOW languages 需要估计更 complex rotation（effective rank 更高），48 pairs。\n\n    Procrustes effect reversal（threshold ~0.52）：当 ZS AUROC < 0.52 时， correctness direction\n    严重 misaligned，Procrustes 纠正旋转带来 +3.8pp。 当 ZS AUROC > 0.60 时，directions 已经 well-aligned，Procrustes\n    引入 estimation noise 反而 hurt -1.2pp。Threshold 0.52 对应 CKA ~0.35 （与 plan_011 的 cliff\n    threshold 一致）。\n\n    这一 finding 直接 actionable：practitioners 应先测 ZS transfer， only apply Procrustes\n    when baseline < 0.52。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: Projection Sample Efficiency'\n    columns:\n    - n_pairs\n    - pct_of_200pair_performance\n    - mean_auroc\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - 10\n      - 72\n      - 0.724\n      - unstable, high variance across runs\n    - - 20\n      - 86\n      - 0.728\n      - captures dominant rotation\n    - - 30\n      - 92\n      - 0.731\n      - near plateau for HIGH langs\n    - - 50\n      - 97\n      - 0.734\n      - near plateau for all tiers\n    - - 100\n      - 99\n      - 0.737\n      - marginal returns\n    - - 200\n      - 100\n      - 0.729\n      - baseline (reference)\n  - name: 'Table 16: Saturation by Resource Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - pairs_to_90pct\n    - pairs_to_95pct\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 15\n      - 22\n      - rotation is simple, low effective rank\n    - - MID\n      - 25\n      - 38\n      - moderate rotation complexity\n    - - LOW\n      - 35\n      - 48\n      - complex rotation, more data needed\n  - name: 'Table 17: Procrustes Effect Reversal'\n    columns:\n    - zs_auroc_range\n    - n_lang_layer_pairs\n    - mean_delta_pp\n    - direction\n    rows:\n    - - <0.45\n      - 42\n      - 5.2\n      - strong positive\n    - - 0.45-0.52\n      - 68\n      - 2.4\n      - moderate positive\n    - - 0.52-0.60\n      - 95\n      - 0.3\n      - near-zero (transition zone)\n    - - 0.60-0.70\n      - 88\n      - -1.2\n      - negative — hurts\n    - - '>0.70'\n      - 47\n      - -0.8\n      - slight negative\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 8a: Sample efficiency curves — AUROC (y) vs n_pairs (x), three curves\n    for HIGH/MID/LOW tiers, showing staggered saturation.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 8b: Procrustes effect reversal — delta AUROC (y) vs ZS baseline AUROC\n    (x), showing sign change at ~0.52. Dot size proportional to sample count.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '~42 pairs to 95% performance 是 directly actionable 的 practical finding：对于大多数语言，仅需\n    <50 parallel sentences 即可达到接近 supervised-level alignment。Resource-tier stratification（HIGH\n    22 vs LOW 48 pairs）提供了 per-language guidance。\n\n    Procrustes reversal at 0.52 与 CKA threshold 0.35 形成对应： CKA < 0.35 的 language-layer\n    combinations 对应 ZS < 0.52（ 因为 poor alignment → poor transfer），正好是 Procrustes 帮助最大的\n    区域。这构成了 geometric explanation 的 practical corollary。\n\n    '\n- name: Probing Control Tasks — Full-Scale Hewitt & Liang (2019)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 'Extend MVP English-only control task analysis to 20 languages × 2\n    architectures。Train probes on randomly permuted labels, compute selectivity =\n    real_AUROC - control_AUROC。Identify capacity artifacts by language, layer, and\n    model。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_selectivity_range:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.26\n    en_selectivity_meaningful_layers:\n    - 16\n    - 20\n    - 24\n    - 27\n    control_artifact_rate_lowres: 0.27\n    control_artifact_rate_midres: 0.05\n    control_artifact_rate_highres: 0.03\n    low_res_langs_most_affected:\n    - yo\n    - ig\n    - te\n    - sw\n    artifact_concentration_depth: 60-100% depth\n    cross_lingual_selectivity_mean:\n      HIGH: 0.22\n      MID: 0.18\n      LOW: 0.09\n    languages_with_any_meaningful_selectivity: 17\n    control_auroc_mean_all: 0.495\n    control_auroc_std: 0.008\n  result_rationale: 'MVP English data（selectivity L27=0.262）确立了 baseline。Cross-lingual\n    extension 揭示了 resource-tier dependent artifact pattern：\n\n    LOW-resource languages 的 27% artifact rate 源于两个因素：(1) these languages 在 model\n    pretraining 中占比极低，activation distributions 相对 high-resource 更 \"shallow\" (less\n    structured)，linear probes 更容易 通过 capacity 而非 genuine signal 拟合少量 patterns；(2)\n    GlobalMMLU 的 low-resource translations 质量较低，引入 noise 使 correctness signal 更弱，selectivity\n    更接近 chance。\n\n    Mid/high-resource 的 artifact rate 极低（3-5%）因为 representation quality 高，probe 有\n    genuine signal 可以 leverage。\n\n    Artifacts 集中在 60-100% depth，与 CKA cliff 一致：deep layers 的 low-resource CKA 已经很低（<0.2），cross-lingual\n    activation structure 不足以支撑 genuine correctness probing，probe 退化为 memorizing dataset-specific\n    patterns。\n\n    这一 finding 是 field-level contribution：此前没有人在 cross-lingual probing 中检查 selectivity\n    controls。28% 的 low-resource artifact rate 意味着没有 control tasks 的 cross-lingual\n    probing 结果 （包括 Xiao et al.）需要谨慎解读。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 18: Selectivity by Resource Tier and Depth'\n    columns:\n    - depth_band\n    - HIGH_selectivity\n    - MID_selectivity\n    - LOW_selectivity\n    rows:\n    - - 0-30%\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.01\n    - - 30-60%\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.06\n    - - 60-80%\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.1\n    - - 80-100%\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.2\n      - 0.08\n  - name: 'Table 19: Artifact Rates by Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_lang_layer_combinations\n    - artifact_count\n    - artifact_rate\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 384\n      - 12\n      - 3%\n    - - MID\n      - 336\n      - 17\n      - 5%\n    - - LOW\n      - 240\n      - 65\n      - 27%\n    - - total\n      - 960\n      - 94\n      - 10%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S1: Selectivity heatmap — language (y, ordered by tier) × depth (x). LOW-resource\n    rows show gray (low selectivity) at deep layers.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '27% low-resource artifact rate 是 methodological warning for the field：\n    cross-lingual probing studies 如果不做 selectivity checks 会高估 low-resource transfer\n    quality。重要的是 artifacts 集中在 low-resource + deep layers，不波及 mid/high-resource 或\n    shallow layers，因此本文的 核心 Pareto/CKA 分析（主要基于 mid/high-resource patterns）不受影响。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Lingual Correctness-Confidence Orthogonality\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Extract verbalized confidence direction, compute cosine similarity\n    with correctness direction, 20 languages × 2 architectures。 Supporting evidence\n    for Claim 4 (subsection)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_mean_overall: 0.05\n    cosine_range:\n    - 0.02\n    - 0.09\n    cosine_en: 0.03\n    all_below_0p10: true\n    qwen3_cosine_mean: 0.046\n    llama4_cosine_mean: 0.054\n    HIGH_cosine_mean: 0.038\n    MID_cosine_mean: 0.052\n    LOW_cosine_mean: 0.072\n    resource_tier_correlation: -0.66\n  result_rationale: 'Miao & Ungar (2026) 在 English 7-8B 上测得 cosine < 0.04。Extension\n    to 20 languages × 大模型应保持 near-orthogonality（< 0.10），因为这反映 transformer 的 structural\n    property：verbalized confidence 由 language modeling head 从 surface-level token\n    probabilities 生成，correctness 由 intermediate representations geometry 编码，两者 architecturally\n    decoupled。Low-resource 略高（0.072 mean）因为 confidence elicitation in low-resource\n    languages 更 noisy，不完全 decoupled。Resource-tier gradient（r=-0.66）说明更好的 multilingual\n    training → 更清晰的 correctness/confidence separation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 20: Orthogonality by Tier (cosine similarity)'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_langs\n    - qwen3_mean\n    - llama4_mean\n    - combined_mean\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 8\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.038\n    - - MID\n      - 7\n      - 0.048\n      - 0.056\n      - 0.052\n    - - LOW\n      - 5\n      - 0.066\n      - 0.078\n      - 0.072\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S2: Cosine similarity violin plots by resource tier, all below 0.10 threshold\n    line.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Orthogonality universally holds (39/40 pairs below 0.10, all 40 below\n    0.095)，confirming output-based calibration methods are structurally limited across\n    languages。Resource-tier gradient 是新 finding，但 effect size 小（range only 0.034），作为\n    subsection 足够。\n\n    '\n- name: Probe Complexity Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'Logistic regression vs 2-layer MLP at each probed layer, both models。\n    Validates linear probe choice for transfer。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    logreg_en_auroc_best: 0.81\n    mlp_en_auroc_best: 0.83\n    mlp_en_gain_pp: 2.0\n    logreg_zs_drop_mean_pp: 9.0\n    mlp_zs_drop_mean_pp: 14.5\n    logreg_transfer_advantage_pp: 5.5\n    logreg_advantage_shallow_pp: 2.0\n    logreg_advantage_deep_pp: 8.2\n  result_rationale: 'Linear probes learn 一个 hyperplane，跨语言泛化因为 correctness subspace\n    是 near-universal linear structure（subspace angle ~12° from plan_011）。 MLPs fit\n    nonlinear decision boundaries that overfit EN-specific feature interactions，gaining\n    +2pp EN AUROC but losing 5.5pp transfer。Gap 在 deep layers 放大（+8.2pp advantage\n    for logreg at 80% depth）因为 deep layers 有更多 language-specific nonlinear structure\n    for MLP to exploit。 This justifies logreg as primary probe and supports geometric\n    interpretation of Pareto frontier。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Probe Complexity (Qwen3, at EN-optimal layer)'\n    columns:\n    - probe_type\n    - en_auroc\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - zs_drop_pp\n    rows:\n    - - logistic_regression\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.72\n      - 9.0\n    - - mlp_2layer_h128\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.685\n      - 14.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S3: Transfer drop (pp) vs depth, logreg (blue) vs MLP (red). MLP diverges\n    sharply past 60% depth.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Linear probes 为 cross-lingual transfer 的 optimal choice：牺牲 2pp EN performance\n    换取 5.5pp transfer improvement。Depth interaction confirms nonlinear language-specific\n    features drive deep-layer degradation。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Benchmark Generalization (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 'Evaluate best probes + CaCLR on Belebele and MMLU-ProX (20 languages\n    each)。Tests domain generalization。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    belebele_zs_mean_20: 0.695\n    belebele_caclr_mean_20: 0.728\n    belebele_caclr_delta_pp: 3.3\n    mmlupx_zs_mean_20: 0.68\n    mmlupx_caclr_mean_20: 0.715\n    mmlupx_caclr_delta_pp: 3.5\n    cross_benchmark_caclr_cv: 0.04\n  result_rationale: 'Belebele (reading comprehension) 和 MMLU-ProX (harder factual)\n    的 baseline 略低于 GlobalMMLU 因为 domain shift，但 CaCLR 的 improvement 幅度 consistent（3.3-3.5pp\n    vs GlobalMMLU 的 3.5pp）。Low CV (0.04) 证实 CaCLR addresses 一个 fundamental representation\n    alignment issue 而非 overfitting to specific benchmark。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 21: Cross-Benchmark CaCLR Generalization'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - caclr_mean_20\n    - delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - GlobalMMLU\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.745\n      - 3.5\n    - - Belebele\n      - 0.695\n      - 0.728\n      - 3.3\n    - - MMLU-ProX\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.715\n      - 3.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S4: CaCLR improvement by benchmark × language, showing consistent gains.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'CaCLR generalizes across benchmarks with low variance。Cross-benchmark\n    consistency is the strongest defense against overfitting concerns。\n\n    '\n- name: Quantization Validation Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '(a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset; (b) GPTQ-Int4\n    vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.3\n    llama4_w4a16_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 0.8\n    llama4_rank_correlation: 0.996\n    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_mean_pp: 0.5\n    qwen3_int4_fp16_auroc_diff_max_pp: 1.1\n    qwen3_rank_correlation: 0.994\n    conclusion: quantization introduces negligible distortion for probing\n  result_rationale: 'W4A16 (Llama4) 保留 16-bit activations，仅 weight 量化，对 activation\n    geometry 影响极小（0.3pp mean diff）。GPTQ-Int4 (Qwen3) 更 aggressive 但 correctness direction\n    的 angular structure 仍 robust（0.5pp mean diff）， 因为 quantization noise 近似 isotropic，不\n    preferentially distort correctness-relevant directions。Rank correlation > 0.994\n    确认 Pareto frontier ordering 完全保留。Qwen3 的 slightly higher diff (0.5 vs 0.3) 因为\n    Int4 比 W4A16 更 lossy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Quantization Comparison (5 representative layers)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - layer\n    - fp16_auroc\n    - quant_auroc\n    - diff_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Llama4\n      - 8\n      - 0.637\n      - 0.634\n      - 0.3\n    - - Llama4\n      - 16\n      - 0.737\n      - 0.735\n      - 0.2\n    - - Llama4\n      - 28\n      - 0.784\n      - 0.781\n      - 0.3\n    - - Llama4\n      - 36\n      - 0.792\n      - 0.789\n      - 0.3\n    - - Llama4\n      - 44\n      - 0.774\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.4\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 20\n      - 0.712\n      - 0.708\n      - 0.4\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 36\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.775\n      - 0.5\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 52\n      - 0.808\n      - 0.803\n      - 0.5\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 68\n      - 0.812\n      - 0.806\n      - 0.6\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 80\n      - 0.807\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S5: Quant vs FP16 scatter, y=x diagonal, tight clustering.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Quantization safe for both models。Preempts reviewer concern #5。\n\n    '\n- name: Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture (Camera-Ready)\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'Full Pareto frontier on Gemma 4 31B Dense (60 layers, FP16), 20 languages。Provides\n    dense vs MoE contrast for camera-ready。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    en_best_auroc: 0.8\n    en_best_layer_idx: 45\n    zs_mean_20lang: 0.71\n    zs_best_transfer_layer_idx: 36\n    global_spearman_rho: -0.85\n    per_lang_rho_median: -0.58\n    caclr_delta_vs_zs_pp: 3.0\n    simpson_partial_rho: 0.44\n    simpson_partial_p: 0.004\n  result_rationale: 'Gemma 4 31B Dense 是理想的第三 data point：dense architecture（vs two\n    MoE models），different pretraining recipe（Google vs Alibaba/Meta）， 60 layers（between\n    Qwen 94 and Llama 48）。EN AUROC 0.80 低于 MoE models 因为 31B dense < 22B MoE active\n    (MoE routing 提供 effective capacity boost)。Pareto strength (ρ=-0.85) 介于 Qwen (-0.91)\n    和 Llama (-0.78) 之间。Simpson''s partial correlation 仍然显著 (rho=+0.44, p=0.004)， 确认\n    geometric insight 是 architecture-universal 而非 MoE-specific。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 22: Three-Architecture Summary'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - type\n    - layers\n    - en_best\n    - zs_mean_20\n    - pareto_rho\n    - simpson_partial_rho\n    - caclr_delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - MoE\n      - 94\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.72\n      - -0.91\n      - 0.48\n      - 3.7\n    - - Llama4 Scout\n      - MoE\n      - 48\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.7\n      - -0.78\n      - 0.41\n      - 3.3\n    - - Gemma4 31B\n      - Dense\n      - 60\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.71\n      - -0.85\n      - 0.44\n      - 3.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 9: Three-architecture Pareto frontiers overlaid (normalized depth %).\n    Remarkably similar shapes.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Three-architecture replication 是 universality claim 最强证据： Simpson''s\n    Paradox 在 dense 和 MoE 上都成立，Pareto frontier 在 55-60% depth 处一致出现 knee，CaCLR 提供\n    3-3.7pp consistent gain。 Dense vs MoE 的差异 minimal — phenomenon 是 transformer depth\n    的 property 而非 routing architecture 的。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended Language Coverage (Camera-Ready)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Expand from 20 to 50+ languages for camera-ready。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_languages: 50\n    zs_pass_rate_50lang: 0.84\n    zs_auroc_above_060_count: 42\n    caclr_improvement_positive_count: 47\n    mean_zs_auroc_50lang: 0.69\n    mean_caclr_auroc_50lang: 0.72\n    pareto_frontier_holds_all_langs: true\n    new_families:\n    - Austronesian\n    - Dravidian\n    - Uralic\n    - Kartvelian\n    - Niger-Congo_B\n  result_rationale: 'Expansion 主要增加 mid-resource 语言（Indonesian, Finnish, Georgian,\n    Tamil, Telugu, etc.），大多 fall in 0.65-0.75 AUROC range。Extremely low-resource 语言（Amharic,\n    Khmer, Lao）可能 < 0.55 但代表 edge cases。 CaCLR 在 94% 的新增语言上 positive 因为 consistency\n    loss mechanism 是 language-agnostic。Pareto frontier structure 在 50 languages 上\n    完全保持。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 23: Extended Coverage by Tier'\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - n_langs\n    - zs_mean\n    - caclr_mean\n    - caclr_gain_pp\n    rows:\n    - - HIGH\n      - 10\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.78\n      - 2.8\n    - - MID\n      - 24\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.74\n      - 3.5\n    - - LOW\n      - 12\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.66\n      - 4.2\n    - - VERY_LOW\n      - 4\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.58\n      - 5.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 10: World map with per-language CaCLR AUROC, colored by performance tier.\n    Broad geographic/typological coverage.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 50-language extension 确认 all findings at scale。Resource-tier gradient\n    smooth, CaCLR benefit inversely correlated with resource level, no language family\n    shows anomalous behavior。\n","numLines":1718,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1718}}}
