{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LrkA5CcUUbQygmVnC3Vjro","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 xling_calib_direction 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (5 个)\\n\\n- **plan_013_probing_controls_v2**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **plan_013**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_003**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_002**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **plan_013** (success): English correctness probes capture genuine linguistic signal: 5-fold CV with PCA(100) dimensionality reduction shows real AUROC significantly above permuted-label baseline (0.746 vs 0.484 at best layer), with selectivity (Hewitt & Liang 2019) concentrated in later layers (L20-L27), confirming the probe is not exploiting spurious high-dimensional correlations. ← 基于 mvp_001\\n- **mvp_003** (success): Cross-lingual correctness direction is model-agnostic: an English-trained linear probe on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct internal representations will transfer to non-English languages (zh/ar/hi/sw/ko) with AUROC >= 0.58, replicating the pattern observed in Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (mvp_001). ← 基于 mvp_001\\n- **mvp_001** (success): 在 7B 模型的中间层 activation space 中存在 language-agnostic correctness direction，使得英语训练的线性 probe（LogisticRegression）能 zero-shot 迁移到非英语语言（≥3/5 语言 AUROC ≥ 0.58, p < 0.05），且存在 layer-depth 效应（浅层 vs 深层 ΔAUROC ≥ 5pp）。Mean-shift alignment 可进一步改善迁移（Δ ≥ 2pp for ≥3/5 语言）。\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 4 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 4\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-13176: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PxKzPQrpkGLF9FTrSKfKxu","session_id":"e2f100d3-931f-4e74-a45a-f78f1352b916","uuid":"318d90de-a862-423a-97c7-6c49a9b74353","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:51:33.165Z"}
