{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ArVXncvT39WkrmpjcUcKNx","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# xling_calib_direction — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 01:18 UTC | 更新原因: Correct model sizes (Llama4 66GB, Qwen3 122GB), revert to parallel download strategy, disk math confirms both fit\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nCross-lingual correctness probe transfer: 探索 LLM 内部 correctness direction 的跨语言可迁移性，测试 probe-based calibration 在非英语语言的可行性。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research phase — MVP 通过 (D004), Dream 审稿两轮完成 (D005→D009), P0 条件批准\\\\n- **MVP**: 3/3 完成 (mvp_001 ✓, mvp_002 ✓, mvp_003 ✓)\\\\n- **代码准备**: 全部就绪 ✅\\\\n  - transfer_eval.py: 5 种 transfer methods 已部署 (zero-shot, mean-shift, Procrustes, few-shot, CaCLR)\\\\n  - extract_activations_large.py: register_forward_hook + post-norm + 70/30 split ✅\\\\n  - train_caclr.py: M007 梯度修复已验证 ✅\\\\n- **模型下载** (并行，磁盘充足):\\\\n  - Llama4 Scout W4A16: ~44GB/66GB，ETA ~30-45min\\\\n  - Qwen3 GPTQ-Int4: ~38GB/122GB，ETA ~2-3h\\\\n  - 两模型合计 ~188GB，基础占用 ~88GB，总计 ~276GB/350GB = 79%\\\\n- **P1 先行**: plan_013 控制任务 ✅ (selectivity 0.262 at L27), plan_012 Procrustes sensitivity 运行中\\\\n- **关键发现**: Pareto tradeoff Qwen strong/Llama weak; mean-shift rank-invariance proof; few-shot +4.9pp AUROC over zero-shot\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Llama4 下载完成 (~30-45min) → 完整性验证 → dry-run → 正式审批 plan_002\\\\n- [ ] Qwen3 下载完成 (~2-3h) → 完整性验证 → dry-run → 正式审批 plan_001\\\\n- [ ] plan_002 执行: 提取激活 (12 layers × 20 langs) → 5 种 transfer eval\\\\n- [ ] plan_001 执行: 提取激活 (24 layers × 20 langs) → 5 种 transfer eval\\\\n- [ ] Procrustes sensitivity 结果收集 + CSV 完整性验证 (双进程写入风险)\\\\n- [ ] CPU-bound P1 (plan_011/012/013) 与 P0 并行推进\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 服务器: westd-13176 (4× RTX 6000 PRO 96GB)\\\\n- 磁盘: /root/autodl-tmp/ 350GB total，下载完成后 ~276GB used (~74GB 余量)\\\\n- 激活存储策略: 先提取 Llama4 (~33GB) → 实验 → 可删模型释放 66GB → 再提取 Qwen3\\\\n- P0 总 GPU 预算: plan_001(80h) + plan_002(40h) + plan_003(20h) + plan_004(15h) = 155h → ~39h 墙钟\\\\n- 距 EACL ARR deadline (Aug 3): 74 天\\\\n\\\\n## Dream 审稿摘要 (Re-dream, D009)\\\\n| 档位 | 分数 | 核心反馈 |\\\\n|------|------|---------|\\\\n| Best | 4/6 WA | CaCLR underspec, CKA depth confound, arch confound, scope+controls 认可 |\\\\n| Median | 3/6 WR | Novelty insufficient (DA theory predicts), self-debunking less impactful |\\\\n| Worst | 3/6 WR | Contributions trivial/confirmatory, control task finding should be centered |\\\\n\\\\n### D009 确认行动项 (已全部执行 ✅)\\\\n1. CaCLR 完整实现规格 → plan_003 notes\\\\n2. CKA partial correlation controlling for depth → plan_011 (最关键分析)\\\\n3. Architecture-dependence 限定为 observational → paper_framing.md Claim 1\\\\n4. Control task finding 提升到 story spine → paper_framing.md\\\\n5. 补充引用: Zhao et al. 2019, DALI, Pires et al., Wu & Dredze → paper_framing.md\\\\n6. CKA: \\\\\\\"geometric/correlational analysis\\\\\\\" 非 \\\\\\\"mechanistic\\\\\\\" → paper_framing.md + plan_011\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-21 | Novelty strategy: CKA partial correlation (plan_01 | plan_011, plan_013, plan_012 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-21 | Revert to parallel download: Llama4 (66GB) + Qwen3 | plan_001, plan_002 |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-20 | GlobalMMLU data decisions: test 70/30 split for Ca | — |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-20 | Re-dream processed (4/3/3), P0 approved with condi | — |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-20 | Clarify P1 criterion: mvp_003 is 2/4 PASS (not 3/4 | mvp_003, mvp_001 |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-20 | mvp_003 (Llama-3.1-8B) cross-architecture validati | mvp_003, mvp_001 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-20 | MVP gate re-evaluation after P1 leakage fix: 2/4 P | mvp_001, plan_003 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-20 | Dream review (3/6 weak reject) processed: 13 confi | plan_003, plan_011, plan_012, plan_013 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | MVP gate: 3/4 PASS，核心假设获充分支持，进入 research 阶段 | mvp_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | P4 criterion 从 ΔAUROC ≥ 2pp 改为 ΔECE ≤ -2pp for ≥3/ | mvp_001 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3556, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01PxKzPQrpkGLF9FTrSKfKxu","session_id":"e2f100d3-931f-4e74-a45a-f78f1352b916","uuid":"f9a2bcf7-fa14-4254-915b-33a4f0933c86","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:51:37.005Z"}
